(2169608, 297456, 1, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured this well.  I felt it looked cold even before I read the title.  The only suggestion I can think of would be to have bumped the frame up to square off the top of the tree in the frame, but I''m pretty anal about stuff like that.</td>', 'You''ve captured this well.  I felt it looked cold even before I read the title.  The only suggestion I can think of would be to have bumped the frame up to square off the top of the tree in the frame, but I''m pretty anal about stuff like that.', '2006-02-22 00:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
