(2169700, 298881, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. I like the duotone treatment, good job. I like the overall composition. But I don''t think I''m crazy about the air conditioner. I''m thinking that with the idea, and title, maybe the same comp, but with computer, or camera or something along that lines in front of the subject could possibly work a little better. Maybe that''s just me though :-)</td>', 'I like the concept. I like the duotone treatment, good job. I like the overall composition. But I don''t think I''m crazy about the air conditioner. I''m thinking that with the idea, and title, maybe the same comp, but with computer, or camera or something along that lines in front of the subject could possibly work a little better. Maybe that''s just me though :-)', '2006-02-22 00:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
