(2170084, 298461, 51638, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing here, but I reckon this would have looked better in colour as the reflection suggests a low, setting sun which probably looked cool. That being the case, why convert to sepia just for the sake of entering the challenge? Also, the building seems to have a bit of lean going. :-)</td>', 'I''m guessing here, but I reckon this would have looked better in colour as the reflection suggests a low, setting sun which probably looked cool. That being the case, why convert to sepia just for the sake of entering the challenge? Also, the building seems to have a bit of lean going. :-)', '2006-02-22 03:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2170087, 298386, 51638, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but I''ll bet the sunset looked even better in colour, so why spoil it by converting to sepia? Still gave you a good score for the quality of the image.</td>', 'This is nice, but I''ll bet the sunset looked even better in colour, so why spoil it by converting to sepia? Still gave you a good score for the quality of the image.', '2006-02-22 03:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
