(2173650, 298855, 46336, '<td valign="top">I do love this. it''s at the level where I can begin to be picky. The sign-post on the road is a big let down to me. You draw my eye right in, and there is a stark sign-post. I''d also prefer not to see the white on the road. Otherwise well balanced, lovely hue, and great curve. 8</td>', 'I do love this. it''s at the level where I can begin to be picky. The sign-post on the road is a big let down to me. You draw my eye right in, and there is a stark sign-post. I''d also prefer not to see the white on the road. Otherwise well balanced, lovely hue, and great curve. 8', '2006-02-22 19:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
