(2174829, 298011, 41337, '<td valign="top">Really nice looking photo. Love the duotone, composition and tonal range. The only negative for me is the harsh highlights in the window which breaks up the mood some what.</td>', 'Really nice looking photo. Love the duotone, composition and tonal range. The only negative for me is the harsh highlights in the window which breaks up the mood some what.', '2006-02-23 02:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
