(2175004, 298163, 23430, '<td valign="top">The vast space with the small moon in it looks great. Nice shape and tone in the landscape too. Well done.</td>', 'The vast space with the small moon in it looks great. Nice shape and tone in the landscape too. Well done.', '2006-02-23 05:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2175005, 298138, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful city detail.  It reminds me of some of the Paris photographs of Eugene Atget, except for the rotation, of course.  But in this case the rotation seems justified, because it forces some depth and perspective into this staircase and its surroundings.  Processing is very nice, too .... there''s really no clue (other than the rotation, and that bit of graffiti) that this is not a photograph from the 1920/30''s.  It''s a very impressive, absorbing work.  8.</td>', 'This is a wonderful city detail.  It reminds me of some of the Paris photographs of Eugene Atget, except for the rotation, of course.  But in this case the rotation seems justified, because it forces some depth and perspective into this staircase and its surroundings.  Processing is very nice, too .... there''s really no clue (other than the rotation, and that bit of graffiti) that this is not a photograph from the 1920/30''s.  It''s a very impressive, absorbing work.  8.', '2006-02-23 05:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
