(2175403, 298610, 36078, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and tones.  Nice placement.  I find the red "streak" to work well with this.  But could see where it would be a distraction for others.  I would have likes to see just a bit more pop in the darker tones.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Lovely colors and tones.  Nice placement.  I find the red "streak" to work well with this.  But could see where it would be a distraction for others.  I would have likes to see just a bit more pop in the darker tones.  I gave it a 7.', '2006-02-23 09:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2175404, 298583, 46031, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. I have to say, however, that the sky and the foreground look like they are from two different images because the foreground looks sharp and clear, whereas the sky is really noisy/posterized. I''m thinking that the strange sky is the result of too much post processing (maybe you darkened it too much or the mixture in the channel mixer just gave it that effect). Some noise reduction would have probably helped to at least minimize the effect.</td>', 'I like this picture. I have to say, however, that the sky and the foreground look like they are from two different images because the foreground looks sharp and clear, whereas the sky is really noisy/posterized. I''m thinking that the strange sky is the result of too much post processing (maybe you darkened it too much or the mixture in the channel mixer just gave it that effect). Some noise reduction would have probably helped to at least minimize the effect.', '2006-02-23 09:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2175405, 298438, 36078, '<td valign="top">The tones and colors are very nice.  While I have seen other entries with alot of solid black elements I think yours really pulls it off well.  The only distraction for me are the power lines.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'The tones and colors are very nice.  While I have seen other entries with alot of solid black elements I think yours really pulls it off well.  The only distraction for me are the power lines.  I gave it a 7.', '2006-02-23 09:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
