(2175638, 298825, 43753, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I really love the tones - gives the image an aged feel. The reflections are nice, and the waters impart a sense of calm.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I really love the tones - gives the image an aged feel. The reflections are nice, and the waters impart a sense of calm.', '2006-02-23 11:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
