(2176597, 298010, 41337, '<td valign="top">The processing is fairly noticable. However, the castle itself is pleasing so the soft halos that are seen do not detract in general. The sky however isn''t as pleasing, IMO. It''s very harsh and it doesn''t compliment the castle very well which has softer tones to it. I do like how there is a break in the clouds so the background isn''t all white. <br/> <br/>In regards to the rest, the duotone looks good. I also like the composition and you''ve managed to produce a lot of detail in the shadows despite the harsh light. Good photo.</td>', 'The processing is fairly noticable. However, the castle itself is pleasing so the soft halos that are seen do not detract in general. The sky however isn''t as pleasing, IMO. It''s very harsh and it doesn''t compliment the castle very well which has softer tones to it. I do like how there is a break in the clouds so the background isn''t all white.  In regards to the rest, the duotone looks good. I also like the composition and you''ve managed to produce a lot of detail in the shadows despite the harsh light. Good photo.', '2006-02-23 17:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176602, 296155, 41337, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see two tiny glasses reflecting the background on each hand to further the pun in this photo.</td>', 'I would have loved to see two tiny glasses reflecting the background on each hand to further the pun in this photo.', '2006-02-23 17:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176608, 297560, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. It''s got a cinematography look to it with the framing and DOF.</td>', 'Very interesting. It''s got a cinematography look to it with the framing and DOF.', '2006-02-23 17:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176612, 298565, 72317, '<td valign="top">the star shaped apparation made it worse.. no offense.. a regular sun would''ve looked better.. it looks kind of... sci-fi.... star wars... wierd.. still a nice effect, though..</td>', 'the star shaped apparation made it worse.. no offense.. a regular sun would''ve looked better.. it looks kind of... sci-fi.... star wars... wierd.. still a nice effect, though..', '2006-02-23 17:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176618, 298143, 41337, '<td valign="top">Creative duotone. The highlights are a bit of an issue for me. I like the lighting on the new rose however it produced a distracting hot strip in the background. Maybe diffuse the natural light just a bit so that the background color in that area isn''t lost.</td>', 'Creative duotone. The highlights are a bit of an issue for me. I like the lighting on the new rose however it produced a distracting hot strip in the background. Maybe diffuse the natural light just a bit so that the background color in that area isn''t lost.', '2006-02-23 17:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
