(2176654, 297933, 12076, '<td valign="top">He is counting the lamp posts???  Actually, I really like this shot.  The posts draw my eyes in and around the photo.  Interesting hill in the background, dog on the steps? Trees leaning to the left, etc.</td>', 'He is counting the lamp posts???  Actually, I really like this shot.  The posts draw my eyes in and around the photo.  Interesting hill in the background, dog on the steps? Trees leaning to the left, etc.', '2006-02-23 18:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
