(2176687, 298957, 51802, '<td valign="top">A little different angle might help get the power line out of the way.</td>', 'A little different angle might help get the power line out of the way.', '2006-02-23 18:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176689, 298540, 51802, '<td valign="top">Great job in capturing the different textures.</td>', 'Great job in capturing the different textures.', '2006-02-23 18:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176697, 298085, 48545, '<td valign="top">The tonal balance isn''t great, I feel like I''d like to see the expressions on the peoples faces, the silohetted tree is nice but as the picture is too small I think this take some of the strength away from the photo - use the full 640.</td>', 'The tonal balance isn''t great, I feel like I''d like to see the expressions on the peoples faces, the silohetted tree is nice but as the picture is too small I think this take some of the strength away from the photo - use the full 640.', '2006-02-23 18:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176698, 296917, 51802, '<td valign="top">Too washed out for my taste.</td>', 'Too washed out for my taste.', '2006-02-23 18:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176703, 297481, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, however the image is too blurred and use aren''t using the full wide that you can, try to use the 640 max width as you will make a bigger impact with your photo</td>', 'Nice colours, however the image is too blurred and use aren''t using the full wide that you can, try to use the 640 max width as you will make a bigger impact with your photo', '2006-02-23 18:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176705, 296038, 48545, '<td valign="top">From my limited experience, photos of statues don''t work very well on DPC unless there is an angle or something else that gives the WOW factor.  Unfortunately this doesn''t come across on this photo</td>', 'From my limited experience, photos of statues don''t work very well on DPC unless there is an angle or something else that gives the WOW factor.  Unfortunately this doesn''t come across on this photo', '2006-02-23 18:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176710, 298064, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp eyes, the eye lashes have come out brilliantly, the shadow under the face is quite off putting though.  More directional light would really help</td>', 'Nice sharp eyes, the eye lashes have come out brilliantly, the shadow under the face is quite off putting though.  More directional light would really help', '2006-02-23 18:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176718, 298143, 48545, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately there are many flower photos in this competition, the contract of the two flowers is really nice, however this isn''t really a duotone and I imagine it''ll get hit quite hard to this.  Lighting is good, however a little harsh in places</td>', 'Unfortunately there are many flower photos in this competition, the contract of the two flowers is really nice, however this isn''t really a duotone and I imagine it''ll get hit quite hard to this.  Lighting is good, however a little harsh in places', '2006-02-23 18:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176725, 296453, 51802, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Took me several seconds to figure it out.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Took me several seconds to figure it out.', '2006-02-23 18:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176730, 298030, 48545, '<td valign="top">As there are loads of photos of pet animals in this challenge, it really has to be quite special to do well.  The photo has a few areas that are over exposed and distract the viewer.  I like the rest of the image though.</td>', 'As there are loads of photos of pet animals in this challenge, it really has to be quite special to do well.  The photo has a few areas that are over exposed and distract the viewer.  I like the rest of the image though.', '2006-02-23 18:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176733, 297008, 51802, '<td valign="top">This really pushes the line between photography and digital art.</td>', 'This really pushes the line between photography and digital art.', '2006-02-23 18:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176735, 298657, 4226, '<td valign="top">Great tones.. love the aged look it gives.. .well done</td>', 'Great tones.. love the aged look it gives.. .well done', '2006-02-23 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176737, 296781, 48545, '<td valign="top">not the most exciting subject in the whole world and the flash is quite distracting.</td>', 'not the most exciting subject in the whole world and the flash is quite distracting.', '2006-02-23 18:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176738, 297311, 37893, '<td valign="top">Just a tad soft on the focus here but nice placement within ROTs.</td>', 'Just a tad soft on the focus here but nice placement within ROTs.', '2006-02-23 18:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176739, 298874, 51802, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Your title fits so well!</td>', 'LOL!  Your title fits so well!', '2006-02-23 18:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176740, 298320, 40718, '<td valign="top">Mmm, could have been quite exquisite.  Somewhat overexposed and that loses some of the excellent craggy detail her face offers.  Maybe a slightly deeper DOF as well. Still, I like it. 7</td>', 'Mmm, could have been quite exquisite.  Somewhat overexposed and that loses some of the excellent craggy detail her face offers.  Maybe a slightly deeper DOF as well. Still, I like it. 7', '2006-02-23 18:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176743, 298131, 48545, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know what to look at in this photo, there is too much going on.  A random man, a light floating in the air on the left, a backward sign and flag that I can''t quite read, the tower and part of a roof.  The tone is good in this picture, I just wish I could concentrate on one thing!!</td>', 'I don''t really know what to look at in this photo, there is too much going on.  A random man, a light floating in the air on the left, a backward sign and flag that I can''t quite read, the tower and part of a roof.  The tone is good in this picture, I just wish I could concentrate on one thing!!', '2006-02-23 18:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176746, 298998, 40718, '<td valign="top">I guess the cage dancer was doing some serious hip gyrating as she''s more OOF than anybody else. :)  The crop is, I think, a bit too much territory.  I''d prefer the center 50% of the picture.</td>', 'I guess the cage dancer was doing some serious hip gyrating as she''s more OOF than anybody else. :)  The crop is, I think, a bit too much territory.  I''d prefer the center 50% of the picture.', '2006-02-23 18:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176752, 298423, 48545, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for photos like this, you really should use the maximum size possible width 640px in this case as it would be so much more forceful.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for photos like this, you really should use the maximum size possible width 640px in this case as it would be so much more forceful.', '2006-02-23 18:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176758, 298460, 40718, '<td valign="top">Too bad her sweater is blown.  Nice pose though. 6</td>', 'Too bad her sweater is blown.  Nice pose though. 6', '2006-02-23 18:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176759, 296866, 48545, '<td valign="top">Its funny in another comment I just wrote I thought there was too much going on in the picture and I said I couldn''t work out where to look.  Then I see this one and the exactly opposite, I want more!  I guess I just can''t be pleased</td>', 'Its funny in another comment I just wrote I thought there was too much going on in the picture and I said I couldn''t work out where to look.  Then I see this one and the exactly opposite, I want more!  I guess I just can''t be pleased', '2006-02-23 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176771, 296993, 48545, '<td valign="top">Unfortuately there are many flower pictures in this challenge and the quality is great.  I like the use of red as the duotone, which works well in this photo.  The light is over exposed I think I''d have cropped really tight on this picture to remove the distractions</td>', 'Unfortuately there are many flower pictures in this challenge and the quality is great.  I like the use of red as the duotone, which works well in this photo.  The light is over exposed I think I''d have cropped really tight on this picture to remove the distractions', '2006-02-23 18:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176772, 298054, 51802, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose.  A little too dark.</td>', 'Interesting pose.  A little too dark.', '2006-02-23 18:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176775, 298371, 51802, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Great idea for a shot.  I hope this does well!</td>', 'Very cool!  Great idea for a shot.  I hope this does well!', '2006-02-23 18:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176778, 297225, 48545, '<td valign="top">The shadow that the flash has made has given this image a real snapshot feel to it, also the focus isn''t really sharp enough and affects the quality of the picture</td>', 'The shadow that the flash has made has given this image a real snapshot feel to it, also the focus isn''t really sharp enough and affects the quality of the picture', '2006-02-23 18:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176784, 298716, 48545, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, the composition doesn''t really help the image and the sharpness isn''t there to help the viewer either</td>', 'Interesting photo, the composition doesn''t really help the image and the sharpness isn''t there to help the viewer either', '2006-02-23 18:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176785, 298850, 48545, '<td valign="top">Yep it is a cliché, the edges seem a little too fuzzy to get that wow factor, still like these images though :)  I know I''m going to surcome and give a go one of these days</td>', 'Yep it is a cliché, the edges seem a little too fuzzy to get that wow factor, still like these images though :)  I know I''m going to surcome and give a go one of these days', '2006-02-23 19:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
