(2176827, 296083, 35602, '<td valign="top">I am assuming this was a long exposure.  I love the detail of the sheet on the right.  Looks very ghostly.  The title seems to me that the upper image should be more transparent.  You may have stayed too long in the upper position.  Anyway, that is about the only technicality I see wrong with the image.  8</td>', 'I am assuming this was a long exposure.  I love the detail of the sheet on the right.  Looks very ghostly.  The title seems to me that the upper image should be more transparent.  You may have stayed too long in the upper position.  Anyway, that is about the only technicality I see wrong with the image.  8', '2006-02-23 19:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
