(2176877, 298098, 35602, '<td valign="top">Tree in foreground makes the composition too heavy.  Also snow detail could have been improved by more dodging of highlights and burning of shadows.  Overall a nice attempt at linear composition. 6</td>', 'Tree in foreground makes the composition too heavy.  Also snow detail could have been improved by more dodging of highlights and burning of shadows.  Overall a nice attempt at linear composition. 6', '2006-02-23 19:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
