(2176915, 297368, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the duotone itself. For me though, there really isn''t any one focal point. It''s a very busy composition and my eyes keep jumping around looking for something hidden in the trees.</td>', 'I like the duotone itself. For me though, there really isn''t any one focal point. It''s a very busy composition and my eyes keep jumping around looking for something hidden in the trees.', '2006-02-23 19:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
