(2176919, 298097, 41675, '<td valign="top">So how many fish did you have to pay the gull to model for you? :)<br/> <br/>I really like the duotones you chose. Nice to see something other than black and white. I also like the simplicity of your composition. Good luck in the challenge. (The first 10 I''ve given out)</td>', 'So how many fish did you have to pay the gull to model for you? :) I really like the duotones you chose. Nice to see something other than black and white. I also like the simplicity of your composition. Good luck in the challenge. (The first 10 I''ve given out)', '2006-02-23 19:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
