(2176926, 298485, 1792, '<td valign="top">Might have been more effective with less of the bright white area to the right.  You might look at cropping it a bit to the right of the table, and appropriately at the top to maintain proportion and in such a way that the subject is not too centered. I like the duotone effect otherwise.  Don''t know about the frame.</td>', 'Might have been more effective with less of the bright white area to the right.  You might look at cropping it a bit to the right of the table, and appropriately at the top to maintain proportion and in such a way that the subject is not too centered. I like the duotone effect otherwise.  Don''t know about the frame.', '2006-02-23 19:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2176927, 298615, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. Lost a bit of her left shoulder on the highlights, but I like the duotones. Good entry in my unprofessional opinion.</td>', 'I like the composition. Lost a bit of her left shoulder on the highlights, but I like the duotones. Good entry in my unprofessional opinion.', '2006-02-23 19:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
