(2177168, 298396, 12076, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...javascript:%20do_vote(5)</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...javascript:%20do_vote(5)', '2006-02-23 20:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177172, 298553, 53888, '<td valign="top">incredible, the duotones makes it look very mystical</td>', 'incredible, the duotones makes it look very mystical', '2006-02-23 20:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177173, 298548, 41337, '<td valign="top">Two photos like this in the challenge? I would never have figured. Hopefully you and the other person with the same subject don''t split the vote on this (so to speak). <br/> <br/>As for the photo, I really like the contrast, perspective and detail. The transition from foreground to background is very smooth. You get a good sense of scale. The lines the rock created does a great job in carrying your eyes throughout the photo. <br/> <br/>The only negative I have is I''m not in love with the color selection for the duotone. I think this would look better in b/w but I can certainly see why you didn''t go that route for this challenge.</td>', 'Two photos like this in the challenge? I would never have figured. Hopefully you and the other person with the same subject don''t split the vote on this (so to speak).  As for the photo, I really like the contrast, perspective and detail. The transition from foreground to background is very smooth. You get a good sense of scale. The lines the rock created does a great job in carrying your eyes throughout the photo.  The only negative I have is I''m not in love with the color selection for the duotone. I think this would look better in b/w but I can certainly see why you didn''t go that route for this challenge.', '2006-02-23 20:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177175, 298928, 53888, '<td valign="top">greatly envied is the man who got to take this picture.  marine beauty well captured</td>', 'greatly envied is the man who got to take this picture.  marine beauty well captured', '2006-02-23 20:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177177, 298923, 53888, '<td valign="top">excellent use of tone and depth of field, simple and great</td>', 'excellent use of tone and depth of field, simple and great', '2006-02-23 20:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177178, 297011, 35602, '<td valign="top">Detail seems to have disappeared with the duotone treatment.  I like the color choice of blue and black, but there is a bit too much brightness in the highlights of the candle holder.  Maybe a little less exposure, if you have an exposure adjustment in your camera.  Also, if you used long exposure, you might want to have the shutter open less time.</td>', 'Detail seems to have disappeared with the duotone treatment.  I like the color choice of blue and black, but there is a bit too much brightness in the highlights of the candle holder.  Maybe a little less exposure, if you have an exposure adjustment in your camera.  Also, if you used long exposure, you might want to have the shutter open less time.', '2006-02-23 20:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177179, 297848, 12076, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then cast your votejavascript:%20do_vote(4)...</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then cast your votejavascript:%20do_vote(4)...', '2006-02-23 20:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177181, 298249, 4226, '<td valign="top">Very busy composition.. smaller image omits the details..</td>', 'Very busy composition.. smaller image omits the details..', '2006-02-23 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177183, 298571, 53888, '<td valign="top">excellent picture, although the reflections on the glass might''ve been managed better</td>', 'excellent picture, although the reflections on the glass might''ve been managed better', '2006-02-23 20:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177184, 298898, 4226, '<td valign="top">Out of focus image..</td>', 'Out of focus image..', '2006-02-23 20:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177187, 298141, 12076, '<td valign="top">Like it!  Color choice works well here.</td>', 'Like it!  Color choice works well here.', '2006-02-23 20:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177188, 296926, 53806, '<td valign="top">i like the idea of this shot, however, there seems to be a little too much contrast that makes it look too much like a drawing.... less contrast or lighting can bring out more flattering detail...</td>', 'i like the idea of this shot, however, there seems to be a little too much contrast that makes it look too much like a drawing.... less contrast or lighting can bring out more flattering detail...', '2006-02-23 20:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177189, 297801, 53888, '<td valign="top">the tones really portray the picture well, good job</td>', 'the tones really portray the picture well, good job', '2006-02-23 20:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177190, 297981, 35602, '<td valign="top">How many bulbs did you have to break to get this one?  Great stop action.  9 just because you might have invested in quite a bit to get the bulbs to break.</td>', 'How many bulbs did you have to break to get this one?  Great stop action.  9 just because you might have invested in quite a bit to get the bulbs to break.', '2006-02-23 20:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177194, 298751, 53888, '<td valign="top">great use of two drastically different tones</td>', 'great use of two drastically different tones', '2006-02-23 20:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177196, 298439, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the pine, but it was at the expense of good exposure on the snow.  Maybe if you could get a neutral density filter, the highlights would be less blown out.</td>', 'Great detail on the pine, but it was at the expense of good exposure on the snow.  Maybe if you could get a neutral density filter, the highlights would be less blown out.', '2006-02-23 20:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177206, 298143, 35602, '<td valign="top">It is two tones, but I am not scoring high on color photos.  I know this one would not have come out very well applying duotone, so you might want to really take a lot of photos to see what works best in black and white.</td>', 'It is two tones, but I am not scoring high on color photos.  I know this one would not have come out very well applying duotone, so you might want to really take a lot of photos to see what works best in black and white.', '2006-02-23 20:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177211, 298723, 18552, '<td valign="top">I like the shade of your duotone. This looks like an iris not a tulip.</td>', 'I like the shade of your duotone. This looks like an iris not a tulip.', '2006-02-23 20:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177213, 298097, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones.  I love the smooth lines created on this one.  Well done.  The only thing is that you might have wanted to separate the bird from the ship on the horizon.  By placing them in the same line, I think the photo suffered a bit compositionally.</td>', 'Very nice tones.  I love the smooth lines created on this one.  Well done.  The only thing is that you might have wanted to separate the bird from the ship on the horizon.  By placing them in the same line, I think the photo suffered a bit compositionally.', '2006-02-23 20:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177214, 298962, 53574, '<td valign="top">Nice job</td>', 'Nice job', '2006-02-23 20:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177215, 296287, 41337, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I''m not in love with this photo. There isn''t anything technically wrong with it. Perhaps the highlights are a bit too bright but there doesn''t seem to be any lost detail as a result. And that''s part of the problem. The mask is just ordinary with little interesting details to look at. Maybe if it was painted or someone was wearing it and you saw their eyes this photo would do better. As is there isn''t anything that grabs your attention. Hope this helps.</td>', 'To be honest, I''m not in love with this photo. There isn''t anything technically wrong with it. Perhaps the highlights are a bit too bright but there doesn''t seem to be any lost detail as a result. And that''s part of the problem. The mask is just ordinary with little interesting details to look at. Maybe if it was painted or someone was wearing it and you saw their eyes this photo would do better. As is there isn''t anything that grabs your attention. Hope this helps.', '2006-02-23 20:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177217, 297585, 35602, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, I almost did this type of shot.  I am curious to see how it does.  Probably better than the one I entered.</td>', 'Ha ha, I almost did this type of shot.  I am curious to see how it does.  Probably better than the one I entered.', '2006-02-23 20:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177227, 297710, 50641, '<td valign="top">Dude looks like a kitty... nice details and tones - only problem with the background is that her mits got a bit lost.</td>', 'Dude looks like a kitty... nice details and tones - only problem with the background is that her mits got a bit lost.', '2006-02-23 20:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177230, 298011, 35602, '<td valign="top">If only you could have put more light on the violin.  It is a major part of the composition, but it doesn''t show up enough.   think it would have been at least in the top 20 if that violin just showed up better.  7</td>', 'If only you could have put more light on the violin.  It is a major part of the composition, but it doesn''t show up enough.   think it would have been at least in the top 20 if that violin just showed up better.  7', '2006-02-23 20:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177236, 296155, 50641, '<td valign="top">:)  Does he also do ''Sink the Pink''?</td>', ':)  Does he also do ''Sink the Pink''?', '2006-02-23 20:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177238, 297925, 41337, '<td valign="top">Too much detail has been lost due to the clipped hilights. I barely notice the smoke plume at the top because of it. The left side of the photo is fine even though there are hot spots but those don''t bother. <br/> <br/>Beyond that the photo is good. It''s fairly sharp and it looks like you captured it while it was in motion. Composition-wise, I''m wondering if you had the front of the train more towards the lower right corner that way you''d minimize the highlight problems on the right and more focus would be placed on the front of the train. As it is now my eyes start at the front and make it''s way down to the back of the train where the highlight problem areas are. <br/> <br/>Anyway, just my opinion. Others might actually see the right side as adding to the style of the look.</td>', 'Too much detail has been lost due to the clipped hilights. I barely notice the smoke plume at the top because of it. The left side of the photo is fine even though there are hot spots but those don''t bother.  Beyond that the photo is good. It''s fairly sharp and it looks like you captured it while it was in motion. Composition-wise, I''m wondering if you had the front of the train more towards the lower right corner that way you''d minimize the highlight problems on the right and more focus would be placed on the front of the train. As it is now my eyes start at the front and make it''s way down to the back of the train where the highlight problem areas are.  Anyway, just my opinion. Others might actually see the right side as adding to the style of the look.', '2006-02-23 20:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177248, 298567, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow, forget prairie oysters, he''s got the whole shebang..  unique subject, interesting composition and lighting.</td>', 'Wow, forget prairie oysters, he''s got the whole shebang..  unique subject, interesting composition and lighting.', '2006-02-23 20:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177259, 298897, 50641, '<td valign="top">Make it a bottle of Jack and then you got a Pug and a Smile ;-)</td>', 'Make it a bottle of Jack and then you got a Pug and a Smile ;-)', '2006-02-23 20:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177260, 296998, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had the overall image been more in focus, I would have scored this better. I like the sepia tone. It gives your shot an old feel for me. Great overgrowth.</td>', 'Had the overall image been more in focus, I would have scored this better. I like the sepia tone. It gives your shot an old feel for me. Great overgrowth.', '2006-02-23 20:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177262, 297277, 26845, '<td valign="top">Is that part of a mortar and pestal?</td>', 'Is that part of a mortar and pestal?', '2006-02-23 20:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177265, 297670, 41675, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. It makes me smile. Good contrast, lighting and the eyes are what shine for me in your photo. Good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'Excellent portrait. It makes me smile. Good contrast, lighting and the eyes are what shine for me in your photo. Good luck in the challenge. 10', '2006-02-23 20:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177270, 298959, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and duotone. It''s the sun flares I find detract from your overall image, for me.</td>', 'I like the composition and duotone. It''s the sun flares I find detract from your overall image, for me.', '2006-02-23 20:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2177271, 297049, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good tough, sports image. Nice duotone and it just wants to make me say..."ggrrrrrr and flex my muscles when I see it. :-)</td>', 'Good tough, sports image. Nice duotone and it just wants to make me say..."ggrrrrrr and flex my muscles when I see it. :-)', '2006-02-23 20:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
