(2177697, 297598, 1792, '<td valign="top">Duotone effect is nice.  For me, the bush on the left dominates the composition of the photo too much and the bit of the bush on the right seems unnecessary.  For me, it is distracting.  If it was your intent to have the horizon sloping off to the right so much, with this wide view, then so be it.  If it were me, I''d try to level up the horizon a bit.</td>', 'Duotone effect is nice.  For me, the bush on the left dominates the composition of the photo too much and the bit of the bush on the right seems unnecessary.  For me, it is distracting.  If it was your intent to have the horizon sloping off to the right so much, with this wide view, then so be it.  If it were me, I''d try to level up the horizon a bit.', '2006-02-23 22:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
