(2177707, 297801, 41337, '<td valign="top">I wish I had my camera when I drove through there in December. St Bernard, 9th Ward, Biloxi all in horrible shape. What struck me when I was there was all the messages written on the outside walls of people''s homes not to mention the strange codes most likely indicating which houses are to be gutted or demolished. Oh wait, back to your photo...<br/> <br/>Really nice photo. Love the detail. and the human outline is very eery.</td>', 'I wish I had my camera when I drove through there in December. St Bernard, 9th Ward, Biloxi all in horrible shape. What struck me when I was there was all the messages written on the outside walls of people''s homes not to mention the strange codes most likely indicating which houses are to be gutted or demolished. Oh wait, back to your photo... Really nice photo. Love the detail. and the human outline is very eery.', '2006-02-23 22:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
