(2177834, 298927, 1792, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually comment on titles, but the title here seems to contradict the effect the photo conveys.  I didn''t score you down on that, but thought it was worth mentioning.  Composition is nice, but I''m not sure that the choice of duotone hues does the image the justice it deserves.</td>', 'I don''t usually comment on titles, but the title here seems to contradict the effect the photo conveys.  I didn''t score you down on that, but thought it was worth mentioning.  Composition is nice, but I''m not sure that the choice of duotone hues does the image the justice it deserves.', '2006-02-23 22:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
