(2178061, 298330, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great exposure.  You kept the details and tones throughout the ranges.  You''re light tones aren''t blown out and the dark ones retain details, too.  Very nice work.  Composition doesn''t set me afire but it does show some action and interest.  Creative idea and well-executed.  9</td>', 'Great exposure.  You kept the details and tones throughout the ranges.  You''re light tones aren''t blown out and the dark ones retain details, too.  Very nice work.  Composition doesn''t set me afire but it does show some action and interest.  Creative idea and well-executed.  9', '2006-02-24 00:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
