(2178343, 296628, 20214, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Boy does this bring back memories! I was fortunate enough to visit here back in 1969 while on R&amp;R while serving in the Marines. The people were fantastic and made me feel like I was home, something that I will never ever forget. I like the tones that you choose to use as they suit this photo well. Good composition and sharpness. (10)</td>', 'Great shot! Boy does this bring back memories! I was fortunate enough to visit here back in 1969 while on R&R while serving in the Marines. The people were fantastic and made me feel like I was home, something that I will never ever forget. I like the tones that you choose to use as they suit this photo well. Good composition and sharpness. (10)', '2006-02-24 02:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178344, 298309, 51918, '<td valign="top">The gray ''thing'' on the lower left side is very distracting.  I think, while the shot is very good, this photo would have been better if you had just cropped out the bottom to remove the gray thing.</td>', 'The gray ''thing'' on the lower left side is very distracting.  I think, while the shot is very good, this photo would have been better if you had just cropped out the bottom to remove the gray thing.', '2006-02-24 02:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
