(2178365, 296628, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is extremely well done. The luminosity of it is remarkable. My first reaction to the greenish tone was pretty negative, but it has since grown on me. I might have cropped just a smidgeon off the left to lose that single, on-the-edge bright spot... bumping way up, and good luck.</td>', 'This is extremely well done. The luminosity of it is remarkable. My first reaction to the greenish tone was pretty negative, but it has since grown on me. I might have cropped just a smidgeon off the left to lose that single, on-the-edge bright spot... bumping way up, and good luck.', '2006-02-24 02:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178367, 298516, 20214, '<td valign="top">This photo has it all! WOW factor and POP! Excellant job. (10)</td>', 'This photo has it all! WOW factor and POP! Excellant job. (10)', '2006-02-24 02:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178374, 298097, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is bizarre coloring, but it''s working for me. I only wish the ship and the bird weren''t in alignment, that the bird were a bit to the left and the ship way more to the right, to produce an implied diagonal. Still, you get what you can getm when you can get it :-) One of my high scores.</td>', 'This is bizarre coloring, but it''s working for me. I only wish the ship and the bird weren''t in alignment, that the bird were a bit to the left and the ship way more to the right, to produce an implied diagonal. Still, you get what you can getm when you can get it :-) One of my high scores.', '2006-02-24 02:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178395, 297884, 50075, '<td valign="top">I like this. There''s a couple things I think would have made it work a bit better. First, I think the line where the grass and water meet could use some slight straightening. Second, like the title says, these birds are BIG. They''re also tall and as it is they look awefully cramped with nowhere to fly. I think subtracting about half the water in front of the picture and adding that much background back into it would have really opened this up. Nice birds and nice shot.</td>', 'I like this. There''s a couple things I think would have made it work a bit better. First, I think the line where the grass and water meet could use some slight straightening. Second, like the title says, these birds are BIG. They''re also tall and as it is they look awefully cramped with nowhere to fly. I think subtracting about half the water in front of the picture and adding that much background back into it would have really opened this up. Nice birds and nice shot.', '2006-02-24 03:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178404, 298386, 50075, '<td valign="top">I''m awake now!<br/> <br/>That''s bright. I like the reeds and their reflection. Also the tree branches hanging into the frame. The still water and the reflections draw my attention to that cloud. This works for me.</td>', 'I''m awake now! That''s bright. I like the reeds and their reflection. Also the tree branches hanging into the frame. The still water and the reflections draw my attention to that cloud. This works for me.', '2006-02-24 03:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178409, 298360, 49326, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject but i would have liked it more if had more contrast. It''s so much of this boring gray tone.</td>', 'Very nice subject but i would have liked it more if had more contrast. It''s so much of this boring gray tone.', '2006-02-24 03:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178411, 298898, 49326, '<td valign="top">I think it''s out of focus and the subject is behind the tree. I don''t like it</td>', 'I think it''s out of focus and the subject is behind the tree. I don''t like it', '2006-02-24 03:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178414, 296964, 37893, '<td valign="top">The focus seems soft. Other than that, it''s a wonderful image.</td>', 'The focus seems soft. Other than that, it''s a wonderful image.', '2006-02-24 03:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178418, 297873, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice light quality here. The layers add interest and a certain aura of mystery to this image. 7</td>', 'Nice light quality here. The layers add interest and a certain aura of mystery to this image. 7', '2006-02-24 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178419, 298728, 49326, '<td valign="top">I like it very much. Great picture</td>', 'I like it very much. Great picture', '2006-02-24 03:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178425, 296529, 43156, '<td valign="top">Very strong character, works well in duotone.</td>', 'Very strong character, works well in duotone.', '2006-02-24 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178435, 298448, 43156, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait, very strong character, works well in duotone.</td>', 'Excellent portrait, very strong character, works well in duotone.', '2006-02-24 03:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178457, 296628, 48545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful choice of colour for the duotone, really nice and sharp and I like the thin clouds hanging over the opera house.</td>', 'Beautiful choice of colour for the duotone, really nice and sharp and I like the thin clouds hanging over the opera house.', '2006-02-24 03:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178462, 298548, 48545, '<td valign="top">So two pictures in the same valley, this one just nips it for me, due to the texture on the stone and the shadow it casts.</td>', 'So two pictures in the same valley, this one just nips it for me, due to the texture on the stone and the shadow it casts.', '2006-02-24 03:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178466, 297503, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of duotone colour, great capture.  I personally think the image should be rotated slightly to make the chair straight, I''m a stickler for order!</td>', 'Nice choice of duotone colour, great capture.  I personally think the image should be rotated slightly to make the chair straight, I''m a stickler for order!', '2006-02-24 03:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178468, 298268, 24486, '<td valign="top">Is it my imagination or does she have a halo. I''m sure she is an angel anyway.</td>', 'Is it my imagination or does she have a halo. I''m sure she is an angel anyway.', '2006-02-24 03:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178473, 298439, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve never tried to take a photograph like this, but I imagine the snow makes it awfully difficult to get the exposure and subsequently the tonal control right.  You seem to have done both perfectly.  I admit I normally have little interest in this kind of photography, but this is so beautifully executed that I must give it an 8.<br/> <br/>(By "this kind of photography" I don''t mean to be insulting; it''s just that such images seem to me to be more about the photographer than the subject.  That''s likely my problem, and not yours!)</td>', 'I''ve never tried to take a photograph like this, but I imagine the snow makes it awfully difficult to get the exposure and subsequently the tonal control right.  You seem to have done both perfectly.  I admit I normally have little interest in this kind of photography, but this is so beautifully executed that I must give it an 8. (By "this kind of photography" I don''t mean to be insulting; it''s just that such images seem to me to be more about the photographer than the subject.  That''s likely my problem, and not yours!)', '2006-02-24 04:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178485, 296938, 30364, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Anyone who can''t get at least 5 minutes'' entertainment and stimulation out of this terrific image has an imagination problem.  It''s like a particularly interesting board game, or maybe the Rubik''s Cube of photographs.  And they look like good photographs, too.  The photographer (or is he merely the impresario?) is clearly pleased with them .. he even looks a little smug about it.  One of the best and most ambitious works in this challenge.  9.</td>', 'I love this.  Anyone who can''t get at least 5 minutes'' entertainment and stimulation out of this terrific image has an imagination problem.  It''s like a particularly interesting board game, or maybe the Rubik''s Cube of photographs.  And they look like good photographs, too.  The photographer (or is he merely the impresario?) is clearly pleased with them .. he even looks a little smug about it.  One of the best and most ambitious works in this challenge.  9.', '2006-02-24 04:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178486, 298363, 30364, '<td valign="top">A great, original idea.  And very well executed, too.  I particularly like the fact that she is watching the movie, and he is watching the photographer.  Imagine how much less interesting it would have been with both looking at the movie, or with both looking at the camera.  I like the effect of the shot being simultaneously posed/not posed.  8.</td>', 'A great, original idea.  And very well executed, too.  I particularly like the fact that she is watching the movie, and he is watching the photographer.  Imagine how much less interesting it would have been with both looking at the movie, or with both looking at the camera.  I like the effect of the shot being simultaneously posed/not posed.  8.', '2006-02-24 04:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178489, 298775, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, which is great to see amongst all the B &amp; W''s. The OOF window does take away from the overall photo a bit though.</td>', 'Nice colours, which is great to see amongst all the B & W''s. The OOF window does take away from the overall photo a bit though.', '2006-02-24 04:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178490, 297241, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice tones.</td>', 'Nice tones.', '2006-02-24 04:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178494, 297988, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great colour, it definitely adds interest. Good composition too.</td>', 'Great colour, it definitely adds interest. Good composition too.', '2006-02-24 04:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178497, 298011, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, assured work.  The light is perfect, and the connection created between the man and the table with the simple tools of his trade is masterful.  9.</td>', 'Beautiful, assured work.  The light is perfect, and the connection created between the man and the table with the simple tools of his trade is masterful.  9.', '2006-02-24 04:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178505, 298160, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this: it has, thanks to your chosen toning, an almost underwater quality to it. The excessive distortion of the extreme wide-angle only adds to that effect. I''m not absolutely sure about the processing for this composition - I feel that I''d like to see it more grounded, to make more of the street level stuff. Obviously, the basic rules probably forbid that ;-)</td>', 'I like this: it has, thanks to your chosen toning, an almost underwater quality to it. The excessive distortion of the extreme wide-angle only adds to that effect. I''m not absolutely sure about the processing for this composition - I feel that I''d like to see it more grounded, to make more of the street level stuff. Obviously, the basic rules probably forbid that ;-)', '2006-02-24 04:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178510, 298387, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph.  At first it seemed too heavy on the midtones, but I soon realised the whites and blacks are all there; they''re just not prominent.  The histogram (I must admit I took a peek) is very instructive.  So was the extent to which the already very fine tones were further enriched when opened in Photoshop; a properly high res version of this must look stunning!  As it is, it''s still terrific and I enjoy it more the longer I look.  It reminds me of something I''ve seen from the same geographic region, I think by Ansel Adams.  9.<br/>(P.S.  I did immediately dump the copy I made for PS)</td>', 'Wonderful photograph.  At first it seemed too heavy on the midtones, but I soon realised the whites and blacks are all there; they''re just not prominent.  The histogram (I must admit I took a peek) is very instructive.  So was the extent to which the already very fine tones were further enriched when opened in Photoshop; a properly high res version of this must look stunning!  As it is, it''s still terrific and I enjoy it more the longer I look.  It reminds me of something I''ve seen from the same geographic region, I think by Ansel Adams.  9.(P.S.  I did immediately dump the copy I made for PS)', '2006-02-24 04:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178513, 298386, 23430, '<td valign="top">Love the strong colour. Well done.</td>', 'Love the strong colour. Well done.', '2006-02-24 04:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178522, 298975, 30364, '<td valign="top">Not just beautiful tones, but a fabulous composition.  And the granular texture of the crop in the foreground elevates the good composition into art.  9.</td>', 'Not just beautiful tones, but a fabulous composition.  And the granular texture of the crop in the foreground elevates the good composition into art.  9.', '2006-02-24 04:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178524, 296628, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good composition and tones. Interesting subject. Pity about the couple of things on the right. Nice smooth water. Well done.</td>', 'Good composition and tones. Interesting subject. Pity about the couple of things on the right. Nice smooth water. Well done.', '2006-02-24 04:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178530, 297536, 43405, '<td valign="top">Great photograph, and for once I think the border enhances the shot. This thiss one should score well. Nicely done</td>', 'Great photograph, and for once I think the border enhances the shot. This thiss one should score well. Nicely done', '2006-02-24 04:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178535, 297436, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen this monstrosity in the flesh, only pictures of it looming above a motorway somewhere.  I love the impression you have created of the lilliputian people idolising it.  Especially as it''s such a casual kind of idolatry; they seem posed for conversation rather than worship.  They don''t even seem to notice the revolutionary who appears to be drilling a hole in its foot.  Anyway, my fantasies aside, I like your clever photograph very much.  9.</td>', 'I''ve never seen this monstrosity in the flesh, only pictures of it looming above a motorway somewhere.  I love the impression you have created of the lilliputian people idolising it.  Especially as it''s such a casual kind of idolatry; they seem posed for conversation rather than worship.  They don''t even seem to notice the revolutionary who appears to be drilling a hole in its foot.  Anyway, my fantasies aside, I like your clever photograph very much.  9.', '2006-02-24 04:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178542, 298411, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is terrific.  It''s the sort of thing that looks simple, and a fool like me says "yeah, I could do that".  But actually, I can''t.  It is a masterful bit of trickery, all the more impressive because it is not overdone.  So it allows me to quote my favourite aphorism: "Less is More".  Great work!  9.</td>', 'This is terrific.  It''s the sort of thing that looks simple, and a fool like me says "yeah, I could do that".  But actually, I can''t.  It is a masterful bit of trickery, all the more impressive because it is not overdone.  So it allows me to quote my favourite aphorism: "Less is More".  Great work!  9.', '2006-02-24 04:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178552, 298657, 30364, '<td valign="top">Volkswagen was once proverbial for the artistry of their corporate imagery, in advertising and in every other form.  Their heyday in that regard was about when this Beetle was new.  If they''d seen this image then, they''d have showered you in deutschmarks.  Actually, they still might ... clone out that white arc on the wall &amp; give ''em a call!  <br/>Every aspect of this image is superb; concept, composition, capture and processing.  Beautiful.  Bravo.  10.</td>', 'Volkswagen was once proverbial for the artistry of their corporate imagery, in advertising and in every other form.  Their heyday in that regard was about when this Beetle was new.  If they''d seen this image then, they''d have showered you in deutschmarks.  Actually, they still might ... clone out that white arc on the wall & give ''em a call!  Every aspect of this image is superb; concept, composition, capture and processing.  Beautiful.  Bravo.  10.', '2006-02-24 05:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178555, 297939, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes.  Clever and complete.  And so good that you did not "correct" the perspective effect seen at the lower step.  I probably would have, and thereby diminished it.  Lovely tonal range and rendering, too.  9.</td>', 'Yes.  Clever and complete.  And so good that you did not "correct" the perspective effect seen at the lower step.  I probably would have, and thereby diminished it.  Lovely tonal range and rendering, too.  9.', '2006-02-24 05:09:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2178559, 298247, 46336, '<td valign="top">This would have been awesome with all four sides.</td>', 'This would have been awesome with all four sides.', '2006-02-24 05:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178562, 296981, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen lots of pictures of "columns with person", but never one as interesting as this.  Beautiful light, excellent processing, but most of all a really brilliant composition.  There''s something musical about the synergy of it ... delete any one "part" (the man, the columns, or the floor) and the experience is dismantled.  10.</td>', 'I''ve seen lots of pictures of "columns with person", but never one as interesting as this.  Beautiful light, excellent processing, but most of all a really brilliant composition.  There''s something musical about the synergy of it ... delete any one "part" (the man, the columns, or the floor) and the experience is dismantled.  10.', '2006-02-24 05:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178569, 296916, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is what the very best of street photographs is about, in my view ... opportunistic wit and whimsy, but laden with allegorical possibilities too.  To have found Lennon flanked by Ali and Harry Potter is wonderful enough on its own, especially as Ali looks so grugingly admiring, and John has what appears to be a can opener growing out of the top of his head.  But to have then managed to incorporate the metal security mesh so elegantly is quite brilliant.  I''m puzzled by John''s shades; how you managed to make them leap out like that in basic editing.  That''s impressive.<br/>9.</td>', 'This is what the very best of street photographs is about, in my view ... opportunistic wit and whimsy, but laden with allegorical possibilities too.  To have found Lennon flanked by Ali and Harry Potter is wonderful enough on its own, especially as Ali looks so grugingly admiring, and John has what appears to be a can opener growing out of the top of his head.  But to have then managed to incorporate the metal security mesh so elegantly is quite brilliant.  I''m puzzled by John''s shades; how you managed to make them leap out like that in basic editing.  That''s impressive.9.', '2006-02-24 05:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178588, 296973, 40338, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!</td>', 'WOW!!!!', '2006-02-24 05:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178589, 296515, 40338, '<td valign="top">looks like a fairy tale</td>', 'looks like a fairy tale', '2006-02-24 05:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178590, 297706, 40338, '<td valign="top">I love the stormy colours!</td>', 'I love the stormy colours!', '2006-02-24 05:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178591, 297794, 40338, '<td valign="top">ooooH! what is it - whatever it is its really cool</td>', 'ooooH! what is it - whatever it is its really cool', '2006-02-24 05:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178592, 298741, 40338, '<td valign="top">ha ha very clever!</td>', 'ha ha very clever!', '2006-02-24 05:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178594, 296080, 40338, '<td valign="top">oooh! i love this!</td>', 'oooh! i love this!', '2006-02-24 05:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178598, 298530, 40338, '<td valign="top">that really is beautiful</td>', 'that really is beautiful', '2006-02-24 05:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178626, 298854, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the mirror and the framing on the dagger.</td>', 'I like the use of the mirror and the framing on the dagger.', '2006-02-24 06:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178627, 297914, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and the use of depth-of-field.  I like the effect of duotoning one this shot.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the framing and the use of depth-of-field.  I like the effect of duotoning one this shot.  Well done.', '2006-02-24 06:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178669, 297638, 35602, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually score well on animals, but his one was really artistic and well composed.  I like the use of high key on the left.  It contrasts really well with the shadow.  8</td>', 'I don''t usually score well on animals, but his one was really artistic and well composed.  I like the use of high key on the left.  It contrasts really well with the shadow.  8', '2006-02-24 07:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178672, 298828, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really dark.  Also your leading lines don''t lead to a subject of interest.  The road is well placed but it needs to bring the eye to something, which it doesn''t.</td>', 'Really dark.  Also your leading lines don''t lead to a subject of interest.  The road is well placed but it needs to bring the eye to something, which it doesn''t.', '2006-02-24 07:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178677, 298482, 27484, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones and shallow DOF.  If that was my dog, this picture would be proudly displayed on the wall.</td>', 'Excellent tones and shallow DOF.  If that was my dog, this picture would be proudly displayed on the wall.', '2006-02-24 07:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178678, 296190, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really nice contrast and detail.  Not one of those wow shots, though.  I notice the chain in the foreground.  I have a feeling that cutting out much of the comp and focusing on the tones and textures where the chain is would be more interesting.</td>', 'Really nice contrast and detail.  Not one of those wow shots, though.  I notice the chain in the foreground.  I have a feeling that cutting out much of the comp and focusing on the tones and textures where the chain is would be more interesting.', '2006-02-24 07:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178681, 298855, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines.', '2006-02-24 07:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178683, 296772, 27484, '<td valign="top">Technically this shot isn''t brilliant, but for some reason I''m really drawn to it.</td>', 'Technically this shot isn''t brilliant, but for some reason I''m really drawn to it.', '2006-02-24 07:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178686, 296134, 27484, '<td valign="top">Nice moody shot, but I think the color tone was overdone (7).</td>', 'Nice moody shot, but I think the color tone was overdone (7).', '2006-02-24 07:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178688, 297954, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great geometric.  The placement of the rail in the foreground really brings the eye down through the center to the stairs below.  Tones are very well done.  I think the grain also adds to this composition.</td>', 'Great geometric.  The placement of the rail in the foreground really brings the eye down through the center to the stairs below.  Tones are very well done.  I think the grain also adds to this composition.', '2006-02-24 07:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178689, 298360, 49773, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition and crop, but I think this would do better in color</td>', 'wonderful composition and crop, but I think this would do better in color', '2006-02-24 07:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178691, 298615, 27484, '<td valign="top">Nice use of white background and empty space.  Well done (8)</td>', 'Nice use of white background and empty space.  Well done (8)', '2006-02-24 07:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178695, 297954, 27484, '<td valign="top">Nice job making a boring subject look interesting (8)</td>', 'Nice job making a boring subject look interesting (8)', '2006-02-24 07:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178697, 298288, 35602, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet this looks really stunning in color.  Person is really underexposed.  Frankly, the composition was very strong, but the person took away from the undulating landscape and the subtle tones in the background.</td>', 'I''ll bet this looks really stunning in color.  Person is really underexposed.  Frankly, the composition was very strong, but the person took away from the undulating landscape and the subtle tones in the background.', '2006-02-24 07:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178703, 297058, 49773, '<td valign="top">lovely color</td>', 'lovely color', '2006-02-24 07:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178704, 298152, 49773, '<td valign="top">I hate frames but this one is really nice. Good composition and focus.</td>', 'I hate frames but this one is really nice. Good composition and focus.', '2006-02-24 07:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178705, 298710, 35602, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a classic Hemingway portrait.  REally nicely done.  Like the leading lines of the trellis.  8</td>', 'Reminds me of a classic Hemingway portrait.  REally nicely done.  Like the leading lines of the trellis.  8', '2006-02-24 07:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178706, 296190, 49773, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more contrast in my opinion.</td>', 'Needs a bit more contrast in my opinion.', '2006-02-24 07:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178708, 298141, 49773, '<td valign="top">WOOOOW.Fabulous. Good choice of duotone. Wonderful capture.</td>', 'WOOOOW.Fabulous. Good choice of duotone. Wonderful capture.', '2006-02-24 07:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178709, 298962, 27484, '<td valign="top">Wow, this photo was well executed by aiming the camera directly at the North Star and using the mountain as your foreground.  Being a little more aggresive with the Levels would have made the image pop quite a bit more.  That said, your sucessful planning and execution of such a long exposure deserves a high score.</td>', 'Wow, this photo was well executed by aiming the camera directly at the North Star and using the mountain as your foreground.  Being a little more aggresive with the Levels would have made the image pop quite a bit more.  That said, your sucessful planning and execution of such a long exposure deserves a high score.', '2006-02-24 07:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178712, 298445, 27484, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and contrast.</td>', 'Nice lighting and contrast.', '2006-02-24 07:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178714, 296902, 35602, '<td valign="top">A nice idea.  The image is underexposed, though, and the candle flames are blown out.  The tone matches the idea, but the overall detail is lacking, as well as too much put in the image.  Need to simplify, get better exposure, and focus needs to be better.</td>', 'A nice idea.  The image is underexposed, though, and the candle flames are blown out.  The tone matches the idea, but the overall detail is lacking, as well as too much put in the image.  Need to simplify, get better exposure, and focus needs to be better.', '2006-02-24 07:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178716, 298974, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image is not well focused and the choice of subject is lacking.</td>', 'Image is not well focused and the choice of subject is lacking.', '2006-02-24 07:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178720, 298111, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life.  I like the way the two background bottles meet in the center of the foreground bottle.  Your composition and toning are really done.  This image makes me want to try to take one just like it. 10</td>', 'Very nice still life.  I like the way the two background bottles meet in the center of the foreground bottle.  Your composition and toning are really done.  This image makes me want to try to take one just like it. 10', '2006-02-24 07:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178721, 296487, 27484, '<td valign="top">Harry looks like a cool guy.  Getting his face in focus as well as the eggs would have helped this shot.</td>', 'Harry looks like a cool guy.  Getting his face in focus as well as the eggs would have helped this shot.', '2006-02-24 07:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178724, 296487, 35602, '<td valign="top">Too much was put into the comp.  You need to simplify.  Focusing on the egg shapes and Harry would have made a tighter comp.  Contrast is good, and the emotive quality of Harry is very endearing.  Anyway, the background left in made the image too busy.  Still I give it a 7</td>', 'Too much was put into the comp.  You need to simplify.  Focusing on the egg shapes and Harry would have made a tighter comp.  Contrast is good, and the emotive quality of Harry is very endearing.  Anyway, the background left in made the image too busy.  Still I give it a 7', '2006-02-24 07:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2178727, 298585, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color to try to make a duotone, but there is too much color.  You have white, black, green and purple.  The image is really nice and sharp, and it is excellent compositionally.  However, for all those others who tried to stick with two tones, I can''t score this one higher than a 6 as a courtesy to those who really went out of their way to keep their images within the guidelines.  In another challenge though this would be a real contender.</td>', 'Nice use of color to try to make a duotone, but there is too much color.  You have white, black, green and purple.  The image is really nice and sharp, and it is excellent compositionally.  However, for all those others who tried to stick with two tones, I can''t score this one higher than a 6 as a courtesy to those who really went out of their way to keep their images within the guidelines.  In another challenge though this would be a real contender.', '2006-02-24 07:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
