(2178992, 297682, 9643, '<td valign="top">Pleasing tone and wonderful detail in this.</td>', 'Pleasing tone and wonderful detail in this.', '2006-02-24 09:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179001, 297881, 9643, '<td valign="top">What a neat effect you have achieved with the angle of light playing in contrast to the angle of the path.  The tone gives just the right amount of softness to the overall image also.  I like everything about this picture.  This is photo art to me.</td>', 'What a neat effect you have achieved with the angle of light playing in contrast to the angle of the path.  The tone gives just the right amount of softness to the overall image also.  I like everything about this picture.  This is photo art to me.', '2006-02-24 10:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179007, 297436, 9643, '<td valign="top">This is the most interesting photo I have encountered so far in this challenge. What a nice capture!</td>', 'This is the most interesting photo I have encountered so far in this challenge. What a nice capture!', '2006-02-24 10:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179008, 297942, 53465, '<td valign="top">good idea, but the kid is no visible, try fill whit flash (soft flash)</td>', 'good idea, but the kid is no visible, try fill whit flash (soft flash)', '2006-02-24 10:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179009, 298248, 1041, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop.  I would probably have cropped the top a little tighter.  Some reflections on the skin, but otherwise really nice.  Works well as a duotone.</td>', 'Interesting crop.  I would probably have cropped the top a little tighter.  Some reflections on the skin, but otherwise really nice.  Works well as a duotone.', '2006-02-24 10:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179012, 296917, 9643, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2006-02-24 10:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179014, 297552, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hm.  Nice bw tones, so meets the challenge.  I am distracted by the grown out nailpolish, and the lighting is a bit harsh.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Hm.  Nice bw tones, so meets the challenge.  I am distracted by the grown out nailpolish, and the lighting is a bit harsh.  Nice composition.', '2006-02-24 10:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179020, 298861, 22612, '<td valign="top">Great eyes and off-center composition</td>', 'Great eyes and off-center composition', '2006-02-24 10:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179021, 298611, 9643, '<td valign="top">The composition here make this extraordinary IMO.</td>', 'The composition here make this extraordinary IMO.', '2006-02-24 10:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179022, 298610, 53144, '<td valign="top">Love the delicate veining visible in the petals...</td>', 'Love the delicate veining visible in the petals...', '2006-02-24 10:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179024, 297252, 53144, '<td valign="top">wish the photo was a little brighter...</td>', 'wish the photo was a little brighter...', '2006-02-24 10:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179025, 298375, 53144, '<td valign="top">Very elegant detailing both in the marquee and on the tiled walkways...</td>', 'Very elegant detailing both in the marquee and on the tiled walkways...', '2006-02-24 10:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179027, 298948, 53144, '<td valign="top">I hope that cute horse doesn''t get tangled in the barbed wires from other duotone fence photos...</td>', 'I hope that cute horse doesn''t get tangled in the barbed wires from other duotone fence photos...', '2006-02-24 10:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179028, 297051, 53144, '<td valign="top">Aren''t dominos inherently duotonic?</td>', 'Aren''t dominos inherently duotonic?', '2006-02-24 10:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179035, 297366, 53144, '<td valign="top">Photos like this tell a great story - a story of remembering veterans, despite them participating in wars that our generation might consider quixotic or misguided.  That, and being able to honor those who served in the defense of their homeland, is extremely poignant.</td>', 'Photos like this tell a great story - a story of remembering veterans, despite them participating in wars that our generation might consider quixotic or misguided.  That, and being able to honor those who served in the defense of their homeland, is extremely poignant.', '2006-02-24 10:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179036, 298897, 9643, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  Normally I am a little shy of set up photos because I really like photo journalism and candid photography but THIS is great.  Your composition is so pleasing, the expression of the dog is precisous and the tone is so complimentary to the composition.  It ranks at the top for me. 10</td>', 'I love this picture.  Normally I am a little shy of set up photos because I really like photo journalism and candid photography but THIS is great.  Your composition is so pleasing, the expression of the dog is precisous and the tone is so complimentary to the composition.  It ranks at the top for me. 10', '2006-02-24 10:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179038, 297368, 1041, '<td valign="top">Did you give this a hint of blue for that cold feeling?  Or is it just the leftover snow on some of the branches that leaves the impression?  Good angle, nice toning.  Image is a bit too busy, I think some more straight trees (if you can find them) would probably work better for me.  Not sure about the white border, it is too close to the sky at the top.  A really thin gray or black line (one pixel each side) and then the white would''ve set the image off better IMO.</td>', 'Did you give this a hint of blue for that cold feeling?  Or is it just the leftover snow on some of the branches that leaves the impression?  Good angle, nice toning.  Image is a bit too busy, I think some more straight trees (if you can find them) would probably work better for me.  Not sure about the white border, it is too close to the sky at the top.  A really thin gray or black line (one pixel each side) and then the white would''ve set the image off better IMO.', '2006-02-24 10:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179042, 298426, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like the smoke in the right part of the photo and the sun hitting that one roof on the left.  Interesting city scene, that works well in b&amp;w.  Sepia would be interesting to see, too, to give it more of an old feel, what with the older bldgs in the foreground.</td>', 'I like the smoke in the right part of the photo and the sun hitting that one roof on the left.  Interesting city scene, that works well in b&w.  Sepia would be interesting to see, too, to give it more of an old feel, what with the older bldgs in the foreground.', '2006-02-24 10:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179046, 298109, 1041, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Reminds me of one PAD participant over at PBase (SteveH) who posts lots of wonderful shots of the London Underground.  I like that you can just about see the frame of the window on the right and the bottom, the train moving in the background, the smears on the window and of course the graffiti.  Lights at the top also help pull the whole shot together.  Great choice for bw.  Not sure how this will go down on DPC, but I really like it.  Good luck :)</td>', 'Love it.  Reminds me of one PAD participant over at PBase (SteveH) who posts lots of wonderful shots of the London Underground.  I like that you can just about see the frame of the window on the right and the bottom, the train moving in the background, the smears on the window and of course the graffiti.  Lights at the top also help pull the whole shot together.  Great choice for bw.  Not sure how this will go down on DPC, but I really like it.  Good luck :)', '2006-02-24 10:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179049, 296311, 24503, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Just wondering, where''s the sax??? LOL. Well done.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Just wondering, where''s the sax??? LOL. Well done.', '2006-02-24 10:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179051, 298325, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like how the pier is centered in the middle of the image, really works here.  Looks like I can walk to the end and reach the horizon :)  Storm clouds also work well for this kind of image, a blue sky would not have been half as interesting for a sepia-ish tone.  Overall, the image is just a bit dark on my monitor.  Good work though.</td>', 'I like how the pier is centered in the middle of the image, really works here.  Looks like I can walk to the end and reach the horizon :)  Storm clouds also work well for this kind of image, a blue sky would not have been half as interesting for a sepia-ish tone.  Overall, the image is just a bit dark on my monitor.  Good work though.', '2006-02-24 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179052, 298872, 51769, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great moment.</td>', 'Wow! Great moment.', '2006-02-24 10:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179054, 297938, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hm.  Always love cat-eye shots.  Doesn''t look like a real duotone to me (but I could very well be wrong), more like anaturally two-colored image.  Anyway, really nice composition, wish the eye on the left was a bit sharper, and you had cropped it properly on the left (white border).  That one''s easy to fix :)</td>', 'Hm.  Always love cat-eye shots.  Doesn''t look like a real duotone to me (but I could very well be wrong), more like anaturally two-colored image.  Anyway, really nice composition, wish the eye on the left was a bit sharper, and you had cropped it properly on the left (white border).  That one''s easy to fix :)', '2006-02-24 10:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179055, 298863, 53095, '<td valign="top">Wow that is a really vibrant shade of blue.</td>', 'Wow that is a really vibrant shade of blue.', '2006-02-24 10:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179057, 297985, 53095, '<td valign="top">Whoa, got a little artistic with curves did you?</td>', 'Whoa, got a little artistic with curves did you?', '2006-02-24 10:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179058, 298603, 24503, '<td valign="top">Outstanding portarit. A wonderful shot. The composition is nice (only maybe I wouldn''t cropped the hat in the left). Very good job in the processing. For now the best for me in the challenge. 10 and goes to favorite.</td>', 'Outstanding portarit. A wonderful shot. The composition is nice (only maybe I wouldn''t cropped the hat in the left). Very good job in the processing. For now the best for me in the challenge. 10 and goes to favorite.', '2006-02-24 10:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179059, 296628, 53095, '<td valign="top">Nice, it feels as if the building is lighting the whole picture.</td>', 'Nice, it feels as if the building is lighting the whole picture.', '2006-02-24 10:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179060, 297112, 1041, '<td valign="top">To be honest, the peacock is hard to see, the eye is very much drawn to the left, bright side of the image.  One of the few drawbacks of sunny days I guess, the high contrast light.</td>', 'To be honest, the peacock is hard to see, the eye is very much drawn to the left, bright side of the image.  One of the few drawbacks of sunny days I guess, the high contrast light.', '2006-02-24 10:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179061, 296628, 24503, '<td valign="top">WOW. Wonderful shot. 9</td>', 'WOW. Wonderful shot. 9', '2006-02-24 10:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179063, 298553, 51769, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-02-24 10:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179064, 298887, 53144, '<td valign="top">did you mean E sharp or E flat?</td>', 'did you mean E sharp or E flat?', '2006-02-24 10:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179067, 297557, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice!  The deer is really nicely isolated against the background.  I especially like how his/her one ear with the signs of fight is set off so well against the black area in the background.  Nice tonal range, too.  The color is a little too reddish on my monitor for my liking, something more sepia-like would''ve looked even better I think.</td>', 'Nice!  The deer is really nicely isolated against the background.  I especially like how his/her one ear with the signs of fight is set off so well against the black area in the background.  Nice tonal range, too.  The color is a little too reddish on my monitor for my liking, something more sepia-like would''ve looked even better I think.', '2006-02-24 10:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179068, 296772, 24503, '<td valign="top">LOL. It has the WOW factor. The DOF is well used. Good job</td>', 'LOL. It has the WOW factor. The DOF is well used. Good job', '2006-02-24 10:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179070, 296311, 37719, '<td valign="top">I would say that is trumpet/coronet not saxophone.</td>', 'I would say that is trumpet/coronet not saxophone.', '2006-02-24 10:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179075, 298097, 45790, '<td valign="top">I don''t vote on contests I''ve entered, but I wish to express my congratulations and condolences for being another outside-the-box thinker and using two colors for your duotone. Very nice and effective. I''m giving you a 10, but alas it won''t stick.</td>', 'I don''t vote on contests I''ve entered, but I wish to express my congratulations and condolences for being another outside-the-box thinker and using two colors for your duotone. Very nice and effective. I''m giving you a 10, but alas it won''t stick.', '2006-02-24 10:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179076, 298439, 37719, '<td valign="top">The whites are way too bright and it appears to be oversharpened.</td>', 'The whites are way too bright and it appears to be oversharpened.', '2006-02-24 10:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179077, 298815, 22612, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF, I would have cropped tighter at the top. 7</td>', 'Good use of DOF, I would have cropped tighter at the top. 7', '2006-02-24 10:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179079, 298429, 45790, '<td valign="top">I don''t vote on contests I''ve entered, but I wish to express my congratulations and condolences for being another outside-the-box thinker and using two colors for your duotone. A wild, abstract picture that really shines over a B&amp;W conversion. I''m giving you a 10, but alas it won''t stick.</td>', 'I don''t vote on contests I''ve entered, but I wish to express my congratulations and condolences for being another outside-the-box thinker and using two colors for your duotone. A wild, abstract picture that really shines over a B&W conversion. I''m giving you a 10, but alas it won''t stick.', '2006-02-24 10:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179082, 297706, 53095, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones.</td>', 'Very nice tones.', '2006-02-24 10:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179085, 298563, 1041, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, detail, tonality.  Wonderful unobtrusive, yet not totally plain background.  Title fits, too.  I think my only thing is that the focus is just a little bit off on the eyes, which are usually so important for a portrait.  I wonder if advanced editing outside of the challenge could help you apply some additional focus to the eyes and change this from a good to a great photo.  I would also crop just a bit more off the top.  Small stuff though, I like this shot!</td>', 'Beautiful composition, detail, tonality.  Wonderful unobtrusive, yet not totally plain background.  Title fits, too.  I think my only thing is that the focus is just a little bit off on the eyes, which are usually so important for a portrait.  I wonder if advanced editing outside of the challenge could help you apply some additional focus to the eyes and change this from a good to a great photo.  I would also crop just a bit more off the top.  Small stuff though, I like this shot!', '2006-02-24 10:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179090, 297481, 53095, '<td valign="top">Title give a nice interpretation of this picture.</td>', 'Title give a nice interpretation of this picture.', '2006-02-24 10:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179092, 298162, 53095, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, the background is blurred *just* enough.</td>', 'Beautiful image, the background is blurred *just* enough.', '2006-02-24 10:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179094, 298928, 46046, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Girlfriend just walked up behind me while I was submitting votes and gave it a "Wow" too (She''s a scuba instructor)  Like the tones.  Since this is a basic editing challenge I think you''re spot on!</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Girlfriend just walked up behind me while I was submitting votes and gave it a "Wow" too (She''s a scuba instructor)  Like the tones.  Since this is a basic editing challenge I think you''re spot on!', '2006-02-24 10:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179095, 296834, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice piece of wood, amazing what nature can sculpture :)  Very nice lighting and even background, just at the top, a little bit of blow out.</td>', 'Nice piece of wood, amazing what nature can sculpture :)  Very nice lighting and even background, just at the top, a little bit of blow out.', '2006-02-24 10:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179099, 298872, 1041, '<td valign="top">Gee, that looks scary.  Kids ;)  Really like the shot, great panning, nice tonal range.  Wonder though what this would look like in color.  Better or worse?  Hard to tell without the comparison.</td>', 'Gee, that looks scary.  Kids ;)  Really like the shot, great panning, nice tonal range.  Wonder though what this would look like in color.  Better or worse?  Hard to tell without the comparison.', '2006-02-24 10:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179107, 298570, 53095, '<td valign="top">Would have looked better if all three flowers in the front were in focus.</td>', 'Would have looked better if all three flowers in the front were in focus.', '2006-02-24 10:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179109, 298909, 53095, '<td valign="top">Could use either more or less colour.</td>', 'Could use either more or less colour.', '2006-02-24 10:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179112, 298503, 51769, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette shot!</td>', 'Great silhouette shot!', '2006-02-24 10:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179114, 298501, 53095, '<td valign="top">This just looks like some random picture you shot at the office.</td>', 'This just looks like some random picture you shot at the office.', '2006-02-24 10:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179123, 297977, 53095, '<td valign="top">The background just looks too distracting in this shot.</td>', 'The background just looks too distracting in this shot.', '2006-02-24 11:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179126, 297519, 53095, '<td valign="top">Your image is too small.</td>', 'Your image is too small.', '2006-02-24 11:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179128, 297040, 53095, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is a stunning photo.</td>', 'Wow, that is a stunning photo.', '2006-02-24 11:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179134, 298716, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones. Looks golden. The subject matter is quite interesting as well.</td>', 'Very nice tones. Looks golden. The subject matter is quite interesting as well.', '2006-02-24 11:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179136, 298346, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very clever and artfully executed. I love the shadow. The lighting is excellent, and the tones even more so.</td>', 'Very clever and artfully executed. I love the shadow. The lighting is excellent, and the tones even more so.', '2006-02-24 11:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179139, 298603, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great textures in the face and clothing. I like the reflection in the dark sunglasses.</td>', 'Great textures in the face and clothing. I like the reflection in the dark sunglasses.', '2006-02-24 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179142, 298559, 43753, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast. There are a few bright spots on the arm and face. Really nice angel and tectures.</td>', 'I like the contrast. There are a few bright spots on the arm and face. Really nice angel and tectures.', '2006-02-24 11:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179143, 298852, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Love the tones</td>', 'Nice shot. Love the tones', '2006-02-24 11:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179146, 298248, 48245, '<td valign="top">yep... no emotion, which makes the picture a bit boring</td>', 'yep... no emotion, which makes the picture a bit boring', '2006-02-24 11:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179147, 298948, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and ton es. I like the details in the background.</td>', 'Nice composition and ton es. I like the details in the background.', '2006-02-24 11:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179150, 296042, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice take on challenge. I love to see where creative photographers will take each challenge. Very crisp and sharp. I love the angel. Tones are great.</td>', 'Nice take on challenge. I love to see where creative photographers will take each challenge. Very crisp and sharp. I love the angel. Tones are great.', '2006-02-24 11:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179152, 298995, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great simple architeecture chowcasing line and angle. Great details and tones.</td>', 'Great simple architeecture chowcasing line and angle. Great details and tones.', '2006-02-24 11:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179158, 297848, 43753, '<td valign="top">I wish you had used more DOF here. The lighting is nice. DOF is just too shallow and focused on the wrong thing. The point of interest seems to be the sandwhich, but the gloved hand is what is clearly in focus.</td>', 'I wish you had used more DOF here. The lighting is nice. DOF is just too shallow and focused on the wrong thing. The point of interest seems to be the sandwhich, but the gloved hand is what is clearly in focus.', '2006-02-24 11:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179159, 298182, 43753, '<td valign="top">Exxcellent macro, and very intersting insect.</td>', 'Exxcellent macro, and very intersting insect.', '2006-02-24 11:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179163, 298650, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great set up! I love rats. We used to have three when I was a little girl, Ben, Pinky (mine), and I can''t remember the other one. We had them as pets. They are amazing creatures. i am babbling.<br/> <br/>I love the details. Nice little light sparkle in the eyes.</td>', 'Great set up! I love rats. We used to have three when I was a little girl, Ben, Pinky (mine), and I can''t remember the other one. We had them as pets. They are amazing creatures. i am babbling. I love the details. Nice little light sparkle in the eyes.', '2006-02-24 11:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179166, 298549, 43753, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I like the wet look. The grain works well too.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I like the wet look. The grain works well too.', '2006-02-24 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179167, 296613, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with Lady Liberty there in the background. I like the dark, gritty ook of the image.</td>', 'Nice shot with Lady Liberty there in the background. I like the dark, gritty ook of the image.', '2006-02-24 11:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179168, 296452, 43753, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more focus. There are a few hot spots there at the base too.</td>', 'Needs a little more focus. There are a few hot spots there at the base too.', '2006-02-24 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2179170, 296446, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very subtle textures and shadows. beautiful light play. Excellent.</td>', 'Very subtle textures and shadows. beautiful light play. Excellent.', '2006-02-24 11:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179171, 298861, 43753, '<td valign="top">What an angel. Excellent lighting and tones.</td>', 'What an angel. Excellent lighting and tones.', '2006-02-24 11:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179174, 298647, 43753, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Might have had more impact had the waters been calmer and the reflection more obvious. I do like the sharp detailsed in the cityscape, and the tones you used look great.</td>', 'Interesting concept. Might have had more impact had the waters been calmer and the reflection more obvious. I do like the sharp detailsed in the cityscape, and the tones you used look great.', '2006-02-24 11:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179178, 298898, 43753, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little too soft. Has an old photograph quality about t.</td>', 'Focus is a little too soft. Has an old photograph quality about t.', '2006-02-24 11:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179179, 296179, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great angle. Nice tectures and tones.</td>', 'Great angle. Nice tectures and tones.', '2006-02-24 11:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179181, 298327, 43753, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful natural ice sculpture. I love the background too.</td>', 'What a beautiful natural ice sculpture. I love the background too.', '2006-02-24 11:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179182, 298565, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the sky. Very smooth and lots of contrast.</td>', 'Nice capture of the sky. Very smooth and lots of contrast.', '2006-02-24 11:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179183, 296953, 43753, '<td valign="top">Interesting! I  love the colors.</td>', 'Interesting! I  love the colors.', '2006-02-24 11:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179184, 298853, 43753, '<td valign="top">The lighting is awesome. Love all the shadows. Tones really work well here, too.</td>', 'The lighting is awesome. Love all the shadows. Tones really work well here, too.', '2006-02-24 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179186, 297738, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and texture.</td>', 'Great contrast and texture.', '2006-02-24 11:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179189, 298810, 43753, '<td valign="top">Poor sweet pwa! Great skin tones and angle. Life at it''s best - for parents anyway;-)</td>', 'Poor sweet pwa! Great skin tones and angle. Life at it''s best - for parents anyway;-)', '2006-02-24 11:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179190, 298472, 48245, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the picture doesn''t mean anything to me. I look forward to seeing the back-story on this picture after the challenge voting is over.</td>', 'Unfortunately the picture doesn''t mean anything to me. I look forward to seeing the back-story on this picture after the challenge voting is over.', '2006-02-24 11:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179191, 298906, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great texture and tones.</td>', 'Great texture and tones.', '2006-02-24 11:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
