(2179482, 298010, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very cool castle.  Like the architecture and the colors you chose to tone it.  The blown-out clouds in the background are a bit distracting, but, other than go to take the photo at some other time, there''s not much you can do about that in a basic editing challenge.  :)</td>', 'Very cool castle.  Like the architecture and the colors you chose to tone it.  The blown-out clouds in the background are a bit distracting, but, other than go to take the photo at some other time, there''s not much you can do about that in a basic editing challenge.  :)', '2006-02-24 13:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179485, 298450, 1041, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Loe the DOF, the wonderful focus on her eye (great detail) and the look.  The reflection just sets it off really well.  The zigzag on the material or whatever it is in the background is a bit distracting (especially in the reflection), but this is still a fantastic shot that lends itself well for duotone.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Loe the DOF, the wonderful focus on her eye (great detail) and the look.  The reflection just sets it off really well.  The zigzag on the material or whatever it is in the background is a bit distracting (especially in the reflection), but this is still a fantastic shot that lends itself well for duotone.', '2006-02-24 13:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179486, 298451, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like this one aLOT!!!!</td>', 'Oh, I like this one aLOT!!!!', '2006-02-24 13:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179487, 297010, 51533, '<td valign="top">I think extra care should be taken with photos of pets: they are so annoing to other people that the image should really be special, technically and compositionaly, to compensate this; the background here is bad, with that black right upper corner; the dog''s pose is strange, except for the heads it''s difficult to understand what you are seeing, the lower left corner is too black and there is no general composition to the image; if they are your dogs, you should try looking at some good animal photos and get some extraordinary shots of the two ;) better luck next time</td>', 'I think extra care should be taken with photos of pets: they are so annoing to other people that the image should really be special, technically and compositionaly, to compensate this; the background here is bad, with that black right upper corner; the dog''s pose is strange, except for the heads it''s difficult to understand what you are seeing, the lower left corner is too black and there is no general composition to the image; if they are your dogs, you should try looking at some good animal photos and get some extraordinary shots of the two ;) better luck next time', '2006-02-24 13:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
