(2179705, 298854, 34539, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image!</td>', 'Very powerful image!', '2006-02-24 14:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179706, 296146, 51533, '<td valign="top">by the look of the border this is a scanned photo?! you should at least cropped it better... it''s not interesting as a portrait or as a night scene or as an urban scene, the overexposed areas are bad, the trees with lights are ugly; looks like a snapshot with no particular merits at all</td>', 'by the look of the border this is a scanned photo?! you should at least cropped it better... it''s not interesting as a portrait or as a night scene or as an urban scene, the overexposed areas are bad, the trees with lights are ugly; looks like a snapshot with no particular merits at all', '2006-02-24 14:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179720, 297112, 51533, '<td valign="top">the lighting and the composition are terrible! just because you found a peacock and managed to get something of it into the shot before he run away does not make it a contest entry!! neither getting it bw; after trying to vote for more than 100 photos it starts to bug me people enter such unprofessional images and clutter the challenge... also the fact that I should leave a comment for giving a photo a 1 when the reason is obvious; ok.. calmer.. the subject (peacock) is in shadow and you can hardly see it and it''s a she peacock without the nice tail; there is no reason why we should be looking at those benches; there is no composition, no appearence of atempt to make an interesting photo; sorry...</td>', 'the lighting and the composition are terrible! just because you found a peacock and managed to get something of it into the shot before he run away does not make it a contest entry!! neither getting it bw; after trying to vote for more than 100 photos it starts to bug me people enter such unprofessional images and clutter the challenge... also the fact that I should leave a comment for giving a photo a 1 when the reason is obvious; ok.. calmer.. the subject (peacock) is in shadow and you can hardly see it and it''s a she peacock without the nice tail; there is no reason why we should be looking at those benches; there is no composition, no appearence of atempt to make an interesting photo; sorry...', '2006-02-24 14:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179729, 297855, 3039, '<td valign="top">Well Done! Excellent lighting and contrast.  Where is this station?</td>', 'Well Done! Excellent lighting and contrast.  Where is this station?', '2006-02-24 14:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179742, 296628, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photo, very wonderful composition and contrast.  Please tell me that''s not a shark in the water:)</td>', 'Great photo, very wonderful composition and contrast.  Please tell me that''s not a shark in the water:)', '2006-02-24 14:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179746, 298143, 3039, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. However, I do not understand the Duotone. What are the Duo Colors?</td>', 'This is a great shot. However, I do not understand the Duotone. What are the Duo Colors?', '2006-02-24 14:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179749, 296336, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting, it gives the photo life.  The glasses seem as though they are dancing!</td>', 'Great composition and lighting, it gives the photo life.  The glasses seem as though they are dancing!', '2006-02-24 14:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179752, 298176, 3039, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and perspective. Best I have viewed so far. Good Job!</td>', 'Great lighting and perspective. Best I have viewed so far. Good Job!', '2006-02-24 14:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179763, 298325, 3039, '<td valign="top">Well done!Great perspective and lighting.</td>', 'Well done!Great perspective and lighting.', '2006-02-24 14:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179773, 297298, 3039, '<td valign="top">Well done!Love the lighting and perspective!</td>', 'Well done!Love the lighting and perspective!', '2006-02-24 14:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179778, 298647, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun, although I think you''ve crowded the top of frame just a touch too much. I''m not sure that the separation of the leftmost tower has helped you at all - the shot would be simpler, and perhsp the better for it in dpc terms (at least), cropped to exclude it. Sure that''s a Seattle landmark, but this image''s impact is not about where it is, particularly. Now I mention that, I''m not sure oit wouldn''t be stronger for being the more anonymous. Interesting stuff though, thanks.</td>', 'Fun, although I think you''ve crowded the top of frame just a touch too much. I''m not sure that the separation of the leftmost tower has helped you at all - the shot would be simpler, and perhsp the better for it in dpc terms (at least), cropped to exclude it. Sure that''s a Seattle landmark, but this image''s impact is not about where it is, particularly. Now I mention that, I''m not sure oit wouldn''t be stronger for being the more anonymous. Interesting stuff though, thanks.', '2006-02-24 14:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179783, 298281, 52416, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! It would be better with backround more visible, good colour!</td>', 'Nice shot! It would be better with backround more visible, good colour!', '2006-02-24 14:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179785, 298654, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has a certain surrealism - almost like an invented landscape. Once noticed, the tiny bit of land bottom right is an annoyance for me, and leads me to think that a crop from the bottom mightn''t have been a bad thing overall, and might also have balanced the composition a little more solidly. Excellent tones from a basic challenge.</td>', 'Has a certain surrealism - almost like an invented landscape. Once noticed, the tiny bit of land bottom right is an annoyance for me, and leads me to think that a crop from the bottom mightn''t have been a bad thing overall, and might also have balanced the composition a little more solidly. Excellent tones from a basic challenge.', '2006-02-24 14:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179786, 298948, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice textures.</td>', 'nice textures.', '2006-02-24 14:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179793, 296391, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely controlled exposure, and with great detailing and a certain sense of composition. Who''s to know, but the impression is that it might have been more successful framed to put the vanishing point more to a strong area of frame - this would have allowed the leftmost tree more ''breathing space'' against the frame also. I like the technical proficiency of it, but am left a little cold by the subject - although it has something to it, for sure.</td>', 'Nicely controlled exposure, and with great detailing and a certain sense of composition. Who''s to know, but the impression is that it might have been more successful framed to put the vanishing point more to a strong area of frame - this would have allowed the leftmost tree more ''breathing space'' against the frame also. I like the technical proficiency of it, but am left a little cold by the subject - although it has something to it, for sure.', '2006-02-24 14:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179798, 297223, 50695, '<td valign="top">good color choice for ice</td>', 'good color choice for ice', '2006-02-24 15:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179800, 297049, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m no fan of this composition. Fror all the evident exertion, it holds little drama for me, the arms and shirts become confused to the left of frame, the tonality and processing don''t differentiate the players from their background well enough.</td>', 'I''m no fan of this composition. Fror all the evident exertion, it holds little drama for me, the arms and shirts become confused to the left of frame, the tonality and processing don''t differentiate the players from their background well enough.', '2006-02-24 15:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179805, 296449, 3039, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2006-02-24 15:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179806, 298982, 49480, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture.  Blue tone is very nice.  <br/> <br/>Whoever cleated that boat is asking for it to drift away though.</td>', 'Pretty picture.  Blue tone is very nice.   Whoever cleated that boat is asking for it to drift away though.', '2006-02-24 15:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179810, 298967, 6999, '<td valign="top">Neat processing, and certainly a landscape that lends itself to the treatment.</td>', 'Neat processing, and certainly a landscape that lends itself to the treatment.', '2006-02-24 15:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179814, 298530, 52416, '<td valign="top">Excellent, go for ribbon nothing else!!</td>', 'Excellent, go for ribbon nothing else!!', '2006-02-24 15:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179816, 296155, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lacks a certain amount of clarity on this screen - whether it''s the exposure, or what is hartd to tell, but it is difficult to look at - I wonder if you''ve taken the contrast on the figure too far in order to get the background that way?</td>', 'Lacks a certain amount of clarity on this screen - whether it''s the exposure, or what is hartd to tell, but it is difficult to look at - I wonder if you''ve taken the contrast on the figure too far in order to get the background that way?', '2006-02-24 15:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179819, 297233, 6999, '<td valign="top">The way the lines work across and against one another is interesting, and I like the contrast work also. Carefully thought out comspotion, and a good moment of light to catch also.</td>', 'The way the lines work across and against one another is interesting, and I like the contrast work also. Carefully thought out comspotion, and a good moment of light to catch also.', '2006-02-24 15:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179822, 298708, 50695, '<td valign="top">great pov on the seagull</td>', 'great pov on the seagull', '2006-02-24 15:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179826, 296367, 6999, '<td valign="top">Seems most arbitrary, without making enough play of the slight wackiness of the comsposition. The light and detail on the flip-flops is lovely, but I wonder if more depth of field would have helped to really play them against the reflections in the water?</td>', 'Seems most arbitrary, without making enough play of the slight wackiness of the comsposition. The light and detail on the flip-flops is lovely, but I wonder if more depth of field would have helped to really play them against the reflections in the water?', '2006-02-24 15:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179850, 298741, 50695, '<td valign="top">you sure there''s only two tones here?</td>', 'you sure there''s only two tones here?', '2006-02-24 15:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179862, 296328, 47852, '<td valign="top">This shot might have been a bit stronger if the dog was looking up at the girl, or if they were both looking at something together.  As it stands, it seems like a randomly timed click of the shutter.  This shot works well though as one to be converted to a duotone.</td>', 'This shot might have been a bit stronger if the dog was looking up at the girl, or if they were both looking at something together.  As it stands, it seems like a randomly timed click of the shutter.  This shot works well though as one to be converted to a duotone.', '2006-02-24 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179870, 298396, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great photo... composition, sharpness and lighting are all great.  Not sure about the tone you chose, looks a bit too green for my tastes.  Perhaps a warmer yellow tone would work better?  Nicely done though overall!</td>', 'Great photo... composition, sharpness and lighting are all great.  Not sure about the tone you chose, looks a bit too green for my tastes.  Perhaps a warmer yellow tone would work better?  Nicely done though overall!', '2006-02-24 15:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179874, 298585, 50695, '<td valign="top">I see green yellow blue and even a spot of red</td>', 'I see green yellow blue and even a spot of red', '2006-02-24 15:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179876, 296953, 51614, '<td valign="top">Very Cool! Love the (almost) complementary colors.</td>', 'Very Cool! Love the (almost) complementary colors.', '2006-02-24 15:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179879, 297942, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great depth here and lots of lines and textures.  The bottom half of this one is a little dark and you lose the person sitting in the middle.  Even without the person though, this would be a nice shot.</td>', 'Great depth here and lots of lines and textures.  The bottom half of this one is a little dark and you lose the person sitting in the middle.  Even without the person though, this would be a nice shot.', '2006-02-24 15:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179889, 298138, 30896, '<td valign="top">very nice angles there, dark, a bit freaky and well composed<br/> <br/>isn''t it porto again?</td>', 'very nice angles there, dark, a bit freaky and well composed isn''t it porto again?', '2006-02-24 15:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179908, 298872, 50695, '<td valign="top">dang you would''ve won motion panning with this shot!</td>', 'dang you would''ve won motion panning with this shot!', '2006-02-24 15:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179919, 298896, 53398, '<td valign="top">i like the concept but the grain hurts this image IMHO. 5</td>', 'i like the concept but the grain hurts this image IMHO. 5', '2006-02-24 15:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179921, 298558, 53398, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the wide angle lens here.</td>', 'Nice use of the wide angle lens here.', '2006-02-24 15:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179924, 298917, 53398, '<td valign="top">nice and peaceful BW image. almost ansel like ;) 6</td>', 'nice and peaceful BW image. almost ansel like ;) 6', '2006-02-24 15:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179926, 298130, 1041, '<td valign="top">Blue tones work well here.  I like the clouds in the sky that add much interest to the image, however, the sky seems a little pixelated or blotchy.  On checking your file size, it is quite small (30k) when you could use up to 150k.  Resizing with a higher quality setting would probably easily fix this.</td>', 'Blue tones work well here.  I like the clouds in the sky that add much interest to the image, however, the sky seems a little pixelated or blotchy.  On checking your file size, it is quite small (30k) when you could use up to 150k.  Resizing with a higher quality setting would probably easily fix this.', '2006-02-24 15:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179928, 298757, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I don''t think it''s duotone. I''ll give it a 6 anyway.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I don''t think it''s duotone. I''ll give it a 6 anyway.', '2006-02-24 15:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179930, 298872, 53398, '<td valign="top">sweet image! into my faves.</td>', 'sweet image! into my faves.', '2006-02-24 15:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179939, 297978, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones!  I suspect that this was a rather monochromatic image to start with?  I think those work best for duotone.  You have a superb tonal range here, and the black background sets the flower off well.  I wish there wasn''t that shadow on the flower (more diffused lighting?) and the position in the frame doesn''t feel 100% comfortable but to be honest I couldn''t suggest anything better.  Lovely work overall.</td>', 'Wonderful tones!  I suspect that this was a rather monochromatic image to start with?  I think those work best for duotone.  You have a superb tonal range here, and the black background sets the flower off well.  I wish there wasn''t that shadow on the flower (more diffused lighting?) and the position in the frame doesn''t feel 100% comfortable but to be honest I couldn''t suggest anything better.  Lovely work overall.', '2006-02-24 15:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179945, 297417, 53398, '<td valign="top">love his expresssion!</td>', 'love his expresssion!', '2006-02-24 15:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179949, 297337, 53398, '<td valign="top">Love love this view of the V|Brooklyn Bridge!</td>', 'Love love this view of the V|Brooklyn Bridge!', '2006-02-24 16:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179964, 296161, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting and beautiful.  The rotation has created a totally different impression, like the subject is pinned against a structure by a high wind.  And enjoying it.  Clever, original work.  8<br/>Edit to add:  LOVE the crop!</td>', 'Interesting and beautiful.  The rotation has created a totally different impression, like the subject is pinned against a structure by a high wind.  And enjoying it.  Clever, original work.  8Edit to add:  LOVE the crop!', '2006-02-24 16:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2179970, 298775, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is duotone. If it is, tell me how you did it!</td>', 'I don''t think this is duotone. If it is, tell me how you did it!', '2006-02-24 16:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
