(2181416, 297143, 8522, '<td valign="top">Another band pic, looking like many other band pics. I like the frontman... maybe more could have been made of his forlorn/wistful expression, although his hips have been posed awkwardly. Everyone else looks quite stiff/bored. Not sure I like the brown/orange sky. My main criticism is that this photo tells me nothing about the band, it''s quite bland.</td>', 'Another band pic, looking like many other band pics. I like the frontman... maybe more could have been made of his forlorn/wistful expression, although his hips have been posed awkwardly. Everyone else looks quite stiff/bored. Not sure I like the brown/orange sky. My main criticism is that this photo tells me nothing about the band, it''s quite bland.', '2006-02-25 05:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181417, 298151, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice feel to this photo, but the composition feels awkward. The blob to the left of the leaf puts me off.</td>', 'Nice feel to this photo, but the composition feels awkward. The blob to the left of the leaf puts me off.', '2006-02-25 05:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
