(2181419, 296864, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this too many times on photos that have gone wrong with onboard flash and rain/snow. It doesn''t look deliberate enough IMO to be arty. It needs better composition.</td>', 'I''ve seen this too many times on photos that have gone wrong with onboard flash and rain/snow. It doesn''t look deliberate enough IMO to be arty. It needs better composition.', '2006-02-25 05:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
