(2181425, 297938, 8522, '<td valign="top">Love this, a great take on the challenge. Shame about the basic editing rules, the specks on the edges ruin the effect.</td>', 'Love this, a great take on the challenge. Shame about the basic editing rules, the specks on the edges ruin the effect.', '2006-02-25 05:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181426, 298103, 30757, '<td valign="top">this one makes me a little dizzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzy. nice shot</td>', 'this one makes me a little dizzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzy. nice shot', '2006-02-25 05:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181428, 298099, 8522, '<td valign="top">A snapshot of a cannon. Why?<br/>Horizon doesn''t seem to have been thought about. Why make it exactly level with the barrel of the cannon? This confuses what is presumably supposed to be the focal point of the photo.<br/>Bad light, there are shadows on the cannon which takes away from the composition, and there is too much bright light on the wood.<br/>It doesn''t feel balanced compositionally. Although you''ve placed the cannon right up to the bottom-left corner which creates a nice leading line, the space to the right of the cannon feels odd. It might have worked better with more space to the right of the cannon.<br/>No detail in the sky.<br/>Nothing seems to be using rule of thirds.<br/>It''s a photo of a cannon... unless I was a cannon geek, why should this interest me?<br/>Sepia tones don''t do much for me with this image, and it seems a bit low on contrast.</td>', 'A snapshot of a cannon. Why?Horizon doesn''t seem to have been thought about. Why make it exactly level with the barrel of the cannon? This confuses what is presumably supposed to be the focal point of the photo.Bad light, there are shadows on the cannon which takes away from the composition, and there is too much bright light on the wood.It doesn''t feel balanced compositionally. Although you''ve placed the cannon right up to the bottom-left corner which creates a nice leading line, the space to the right of the cannon feels odd. It might have worked better with more space to the right of the cannon.No detail in the sky.Nothing seems to be using rule of thirds.It''s a photo of a cannon... unless I was a cannon geek, why should this interest me?Sepia tones don''t do much for me with this image, and it seems a bit low on contrast.', '2006-02-25 05:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181430, 296815, 8522, '<td valign="top">Humourous snapshot for the family, not a very well carried out shot in a photo challenge.<br/>Onboard flash and high ISO hasn''t worked well here. Composition isn''t bad though, at least it''s not dead centre.</td>', 'Humourous snapshot for the family, not a very well carried out shot in a photo challenge.Onboard flash and high ISO hasn''t worked well here. Composition isn''t bad though, at least it''s not dead centre.', '2006-02-25 05:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181432, 296998, 47956, '<td valign="top">Looks like an old WWII photo and really got my attention. 8</td>', 'Looks like an old WWII photo and really got my attention. 8', '2006-02-25 05:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181433, 296487, 8522, '<td valign="top">Could do with darker shadow tones, but a nice documentary portrait. I''d have made more of the eggs in the foreground and avoided the overexposed background to the left by repositioning myself. Shame it''s not sharper.</td>', 'Could do with darker shadow tones, but a nice documentary portrait. I''d have made more of the eggs in the foreground and avoided the overexposed background to the left by repositioning myself. Shame it''s not sharper.', '2006-02-25 05:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181434, 297040, 47956, '<td valign="top">The background overwhelms the rest of the frame. 5</td>', 'The background overwhelms the rest of the frame. 5', '2006-02-25 05:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181436, 298631, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not clear enough to have real impact, it took me a while to work out that it was some kind of beam below the shoreline. Sky is nowhere near interesting enough. The textures captured here seem like an afterthought, rather than the reason why you took the photo. Nothing seems in focus.</td>', 'Not clear enough to have real impact, it took me a while to work out that it was some kind of beam below the shoreline. Sky is nowhere near interesting enough. The textures captured here seem like an afterthought, rather than the reason why you took the photo. Nothing seems in focus.', '2006-02-25 05:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181437, 296686, 47956, '<td valign="top">Great composition but I think it would benefit by doing it with warm/hot colours, looks more like a snow scene here. 6</td>', 'Great composition but I think it would benefit by doing it with warm/hot colours, looks more like a snow scene here. 6', '2006-02-25 05:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181438, 298963, 8522, '<td valign="top">The silhouettes aren''t striking and simple enough for this to have real impact. The foreground takes up quite a bit of the shot, and the shadow detail isn''t interesting enough to keep my attention. Compositionally a bit bleh, but when you find the right tree this would be a great shot. Just leave more of the foreground out.</td>', 'The silhouettes aren''t striking and simple enough for this to have real impact. The foreground takes up quite a bit of the shot, and the shadow detail isn''t interesting enough to keep my attention. Compositionally a bit bleh, but when you find the right tree this would be a great shot. Just leave more of the foreground out.', '2006-02-25 05:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181439, 297049, 47956, '<td valign="top">Serious stuff and a great shot exuding lots of determination and emotion. 9</td>', 'Serious stuff and a great shot exuding lots of determination and emotion. 9', '2006-02-25 05:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181440, 298498, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, great abstract. It''s the top half of the photo that really makes this work. Not quite sure that the exact duotone you chose has complemented this, but the composition has worked well. Not sure about your burnt out highlights at the bottom.</td>', 'Wow, great abstract. It''s the top half of the photo that really makes this work. Not quite sure that the exact duotone you chose has complemented this, but the composition has worked well. Not sure about your burnt out highlights at the bottom.', '2006-02-25 05:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181444, 298779, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like the way you used mostly the red channel to make the clouds stand out, what a lovely sky. Boat seems a bit boring though, and a little too near the centre of the frame to make this feel dynamic. I''d have thought about zooming out, getting loads more sky and put the boat right at the edge of the frame.</td>', 'I like the way you used mostly the red channel to make the clouds stand out, what a lovely sky. Boat seems a bit boring though, and a little too near the centre of the frame to make this feel dynamic. I''d have thought about zooming out, getting loads more sky and put the boat right at the edge of the frame.', '2006-02-25 05:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181445, 297355, 8522, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel seasick, it''s wonky.</td>', 'Makes me feel seasick, it''s wonky.', '2006-02-25 05:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181446, 298467, 47956, '<td valign="top">Eye wandering all over the place, nothing to focus on. Ya gotta have a subject. 4</td>', 'Eye wandering all over the place, nothing to focus on. Ya gotta have a subject. 4', '2006-02-25 05:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181448, 298162, 47956, '<td valign="top">Strong composition, i can feel the ambience in this, the simplicity is also a big plus 9</td>', 'Strong composition, i can feel the ambience in this, the simplicity is also a big plus 9', '2006-02-25 05:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181449, 298482, 8522, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a fantastic expression but it looks like a lucky capture for an amateur rather than a professional shot, here''s why:<br/>You''ve not made the most of the composition... this would have real impact if the dog was on the right hand of the frame with loads of negative space in the rest of the frame.<br/>Highlights are burnt out on the dog''s fur.<br/>The background is way too similar in texture and colour to the dog which makes this photo lose a lot of it''s potential power.<br/>But your timing really is superb here.</td>', 'You''ve captured a fantastic expression but it looks like a lucky capture for an amateur rather than a professional shot, here''s why:You''ve not made the most of the composition... this would have real impact if the dog was on the right hand of the frame with loads of negative space in the rest of the frame.Highlights are burnt out on the dog''s fur.The background is way too similar in texture and colour to the dog which makes this photo lose a lot of it''s potential power.But your timing really is superb here.', '2006-02-25 05:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2181451, 298817, 47956, '<td valign="top">If there was a stripe of paint following the brush it would have been really good. As it is, there is nothing of interest in the shot. 5</td>', 'If there was a stripe of paint following the brush it would have been really good. As it is, there is nothing of interest in the shot. 5', '2006-02-25 05:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
