(2185182, 298717, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice stop action photo. The contrast is good, it''s sharp and the background is pleasing. <br/> <br/>I''m pretty sure someone has already mentioned this but just in case not, I think you made a mistake shooting this landscape style instead of portrait. As is there is no sense of height. Had you shot this as a portrait with lots of negative space below the bike I bet this would have scored a lot higher. However with that said, I still give this an 8. You can always easily change it for print purposes with that nicely even background.</td>', 'Very nice stop action photo. The contrast is good, it''s sharp and the background is pleasing.  I''m pretty sure someone has already mentioned this but just in case not, I think you made a mistake shooting this landscape style instead of portrait. As is there is no sense of height. Had you shot this as a portrait with lots of negative space below the bike I bet this would have scored a lot higher. However with that said, I still give this an 8. You can always easily change it for print purposes with that nicely even background.', '2006-02-26 20:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
