(2185219, 296391, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice duotone choice. I like the detail and the image is sharp. Overall, the image is very easy on the eyes. <br/> <br/>The only thing I''m not to crazy about is the angle. I''m wondering how this would look if you shot it from an angle closer to the ground. That way the detail in the snow would be more prevalent and thus be more of a starting focus point to lead your eyes from the bottom to the top of this nice image. As it is now my eyes want to go straight to the middle.</td>', 'Nice duotone choice. I like the detail and the image is sharp. Overall, the image is very easy on the eyes.  The only thing I''m not to crazy about is the angle. I''m wondering how this would look if you shot it from an angle closer to the ground. That way the detail in the snow would be more prevalent and thus be more of a starting focus point to lead your eyes from the bottom to the top of this nice image. As it is now my eyes want to go straight to the middle.', '2006-02-26 20:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
