(2185277, 297978, 41337, '<td valign="top">This has very nice tones and the detail is good. I like the color and the play on the title name. The crop I''m not crazy about. It''s not that you didn''t include the whole flower but rather the dark areas seen at top right and lower right corners. Can''t really explain it but they bother me. Regardless of that I give it an 8.</td>', 'This has very nice tones and the detail is good. I like the color and the play on the title name. The crop I''m not crazy about. It''s not that you didn''t include the whole flower but rather the dark areas seen at top right and lower right corners. Can''t really explain it but they bother me. Regardless of that I give it an 8.', '2006-02-26 20:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
