(2185299, 296484, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Good exposure. It''s sharp. Overall, it''s very stylish. This one has good contrast but maybe you could have pushed it a bit more in that direction. I really like high contrast images so take that with a grain of salt.:)</td>', 'Very nice image. Good exposure. It''s sharp. Overall, it''s very stylish. This one has good contrast but maybe you could have pushed it a bit more in that direction. I really like high contrast images so take that with a grain of salt.:)', '2006-02-26 20:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
