(2185305, 298544, 41337, '<td valign="top">Mmm nice.  I like how you got the delicate details throughout the flower despite the shallow DOF. This really pops and is one of the best photos in this challenge.</td>', 'Mmm nice.  I like how you got the delicate details throughout the flower despite the shallow DOF. This really pops and is one of the best photos in this challenge.', '2006-02-26 20:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
