(2185315, 296324, 41337, '<td valign="top">This is a very odd photo for me. I''m more of a high contrast type of guy but the level of contrast here doesn''t really bother me. Nor does the color, which works. Also the detail is good. What I find odd is the photo, for a lack of a better word, is in conflict. There is such a prominent dividing line in this photograph that it makes it a little hard on the eyes at least for me. Maybe if there was some meaning behind that it would work but for me I don''t see one. Maybe if you shot at a lower angle you could have shown some separation in the arches?</td>', 'This is a very odd photo for me. I''m more of a high contrast type of guy but the level of contrast here doesn''t really bother me. Nor does the color, which works. Also the detail is good. What I find odd is the photo, for a lack of a better word, is in conflict. There is such a prominent dividing line in this photograph that it makes it a little hard on the eyes at least for me. Maybe if there was some meaning behind that it would work but for me I don''t see one. Maybe if you shot at a lower angle you could have shown some separation in the arches?', '2006-02-26 21:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185319, 298952, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice choice in background. Don''t really have anything else to add except this is really good. This works perfectly as a duotone. Gets a 9 from me.</td>', 'Nice choice in background. Don''t really have anything else to add except this is really good. This works perfectly as a duotone. Gets a 9 from me.', '2006-02-26 21:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
