(2185396, 296134, 1, '<td valign="top">Awesome image, but the foreground is a bit distracting.. maybe moving the subject down in the frame (more sky less ground) would''ve been a stronger impact.</td>', 'Awesome image, but the foreground is a bit distracting.. maybe moving the subject down in the frame (more sky less ground) would''ve been a stronger impact.', '2006-02-26 21:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185404, 297112, 41337, '<td valign="top">Tough to make out the peacock in this. Maybe use a flash? or wait until he moved more into the light? In addition to the lighting, the background is also a problem (too distracting). If possible I''d suggest at least going with a shallow DOF to blur as much of that out as you can or just wait for the peacock to move somewhere else with a less distracting background. <br/> <br/>Composition-wise, you did get the peacock off center which is good. He is looking to the right so maybe it would have been better to off-center him on the left and have negative space in the direction he is looking.</td>', 'Tough to make out the peacock in this. Maybe use a flash? or wait until he moved more into the light? In addition to the lighting, the background is also a problem (too distracting). If possible I''d suggest at least going with a shallow DOF to blur as much of that out as you can or just wait for the peacock to move somewhere else with a less distracting background.  Composition-wise, you did get the peacock off center which is good. He is looking to the right so maybe it would have been better to off-center him on the left and have negative space in the direction he is looking.', '2006-02-26 21:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185412, 296620, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice. The lighting really works here.</td>', 'Nice. The lighting really works here.', '2006-02-26 21:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
