(2187092, 297751, 9643, '<td valign="top">This is interesting to look at and makes a good duotone.  The architecture of the structure is fascinating and the portrait in the forground really compliments the composition.  Very very nice and one of my personal favorites in this collection.  9</td>', 'This is interesting to look at and makes a good duotone.  The architecture of the structure is fascinating and the portrait in the forground really compliments the composition.  Very very nice and one of my personal favorites in this collection.  9', '2006-02-27 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
