(2187107, 297738, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice image...to be blunt this isn''t the most exciting picture.  I would probably put this down to a couple of things, the sky isn''t as powerful as some images I''ve seen (probably because it is natural, not a dodged and burnt sky).  Also there is no eyecandy in the foreground, that could provide interest to the viewer.  Finally it is split almost half sky half mountain again this doesn''t really make for interesting photographs.  I would like to climb it though!</td>', 'Nice image...to be blunt this isn''t the most exciting picture.  I would probably put this down to a couple of things, the sky isn''t as powerful as some images I''ve seen (probably because it is natural, not a dodged and burnt sky).  Also there is no eyecandy in the foreground, that could provide interest to the viewer.  Finally it is split almost half sky half mountain again this doesn''t really make for interesting photographs.  I would like to climb it though!', '2006-02-27 12:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2187109, 298485, 48545, '<td valign="top">It all seems too washed out, not sure if this was the effect you were going for but it doesn''t do it for me.  I think this was work much better if there was more tone in the leaves of the plant.</td>', 'It all seems too washed out, not sure if this was the effect you were going for but it doesn''t do it for me.  I think this was work much better if there was more tone in the leaves of the plant.', '2006-02-27 12:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
