(2187113, 297477, 48545, '<td valign="top">I think pet pictures have to be really really special to get the good marks.  This one appears a little washed out, grainy and the focus isn''t really nailed.  However, it did make me smile so I upped a point</td>', 'I think pet pictures have to be really really special to get the good marks.  This one appears a little washed out, grainy and the focus isn''t really nailed.  However, it did make me smile so I upped a point', '2006-02-27 13:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
