(2188188, 298583, 39144, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition with the white fence set against a background of dark grey rocks, and the sky not blown out, but there just seems to be too much emphasis on the rocks, and yet they really don''t get big enough to draw my attention to them.</td>', 'Very nice composition with the white fence set against a background of dark grey rocks, and the sky not blown out, but there just seems to be too much emphasis on the rocks, and yet they really don''t get big enough to draw my attention to them.', '2006-02-27 20:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
