(2188220, 296953, 39144, '<td valign="top">Whether or not this is an acutal photograph makes no difference to me. All I can say is that this image comes across as something taken very poorly, and then worked over in PP way too much.</td>', 'Whether or not this is an acutal photograph makes no difference to me. All I can say is that this image comes across as something taken very poorly, and then worked over in PP way too much.', '2006-02-27 20:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
