(2189114, 298331, 50626, '<td valign="top">Somehow, a bunny doesn''t really strike me as the animal to have a watchful eye... that''s more of an eagle-thing, isn''t it?</td>', 'Somehow, a bunny doesn''t really strike me as the animal to have a watchful eye... that''s more of an eagle-thing, isn''t it?', '2006-02-28 04:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189115, 298625, 50626, '<td valign="top">Wow - this is almost ~literally~ duotone... and I mean like having exactly two colors. Well, maybe three, if we could do with a median gray for the sky but otherwise it feels like a pure black and a pure white image. Having said that, it''s a little over the top for me :)</td>', 'Wow - this is almost ~literally~ duotone... and I mean like having exactly two colors. Well, maybe three, if we could do with a median gray for the sky but otherwise it feels like a pure black and a pure white image. Having said that, it''s a little over the top for me :)', '2006-02-28 04:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189116, 298621, 50626, '<td valign="top">Looks like there''s a splash of running water going on there... but the duotone processing takes a lot away from that.</td>', 'Looks like there''s a splash of running water going on there... but the duotone processing takes a lot away from that.', '2006-02-28 04:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189117, 296834, 50626, '<td valign="top">Ah - just a tad more negative space on the top half, and I would have bumped up my rating - I''m liking it :)</td>', 'Ah - just a tad more negative space on the top half, and I would have bumped up my rating - I''m liking it :)', '2006-02-28 04:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189118, 298895, 50626, '<td valign="top">Far too complex for my taste... you know, it being duotone and all.</td>', 'Far too complex for my taste... you know, it being duotone and all.', '2006-02-28 04:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189120, 296688, 50626, '<td valign="top">Whoa - I seriously got the feeling I was missing something on the top half of the image, so I kept scrolling upwards, only to find I was already at the top of the page. The setting seems fitting to a jeans commercial... a nice, raw environment.</td>', 'Whoa - I seriously got the feeling I was missing something on the top half of the image, so I kept scrolling upwards, only to find I was already at the top of the page. The setting seems fitting to a jeans commercial... a nice, raw environment.', '2006-02-28 04:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189121, 298189, 50626, '<td valign="top">Good idea... it''d been fun to see a color version of this photo as well :)</td>', 'Good idea... it''d been fun to see a color version of this photo as well :)', '2006-02-28 04:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189122, 297942, 50626, '<td valign="top">Hey, there''s someone in that picture... took me a while to notice. Did you try lowering your POV in any of the takes?</td>', 'Hey, there''s someone in that picture... took me a while to notice. Did you try lowering your POV in any of the takes?', '2006-02-28 04:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189124, 298640, 50626, '<td valign="top">Now wait a minute... are we going to see more from this series in future contests with a mildly adult theme to them? I really feel like this photo wasn''t taken with the intent to make it a good duotone image...</td>', 'Now wait a minute... are we going to see more from this series in future contests with a mildly adult theme to them? I really feel like this photo wasn''t taken with the intent to make it a good duotone image...', '2006-02-28 04:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189125, 296161, 50626, '<td valign="top">Again, I find myself scrolling upwards because I feel the image is cropped a little too tightly on the top half. Good image, nonethenless...</td>', 'Again, I find myself scrolling upwards because I feel the image is cropped a little too tightly on the top half. Good image, nonethenless...', '2006-02-28 04:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189129, 297690, 16046, '<td valign="top">very nice image</td>', 'very nice image', '2006-02-28 04:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189131, 298176, 23430, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing there''s no clutter around the house. Great shot.</td>', 'It''s amazing there''s no clutter around the house. Great shot.', '2006-02-28 04:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189133, 297009, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great colour</td>', 'Great colour', '2006-02-28 04:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189135, 298624, 50626, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear - no doubt.</td>', 'Crisp and clear - no doubt.', '2006-02-28 04:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189136, 297548, 50626, '<td valign="top">Who''s waiting? For what... I''m lost.</td>', 'Who''s waiting? For what... I''m lost.', '2006-02-28 04:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189137, 298162, 23430, '<td valign="top">The space is great</td>', 'The space is great', '2006-02-28 04:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189138, 298467, 50626, '<td valign="top">Looks like something I''d have expected from real estate advertisements in the late 1800''s ;)</td>', 'Looks like something I''d have expected from real estate advertisements in the late 1800''s ;)', '2006-02-28 04:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189142, 298593, 50626, '<td valign="top">Kudos for the 100% duotone - hang that up along with two colorized versions and you''ve got yourself a little Andy Warhol of your own.</td>', 'Kudos for the 100% duotone - hang that up along with two colorized versions and you''ve got yourself a little Andy Warhol of your own.', '2006-02-28 04:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189146, 298346, 50626, '<td valign="top">Here we go - we''ve got a hot one! I love the ambiguity... plus, a statue like that falls nicely into a duotone theme, as we know it''s all white so there''s no loss of colour variations.</td>', 'Here we go - we''ve got a hot one! I love the ambiguity... plus, a statue like that falls nicely into a duotone theme, as we know it''s all white so there''s no loss of colour variations.', '2006-02-28 04:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189149, 297477, 50626, '<td valign="top">That cropping of the tounge really disturbs me... first, I though someone had two fingers up the mouth of the dog! :| Still, there seems to be a little white spot in the middle bottom half, which my be the reason it was cropped so tightly.</td>', 'That cropping of the tounge really disturbs me... first, I though someone had two fingers up the mouth of the dog! :| Still, there seems to be a little white spot in the middle bottom half, which my be the reason it was cropped so tightly.', '2006-02-28 04:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189151, 298085, 50626, '<td valign="top">The title''s confusing to me... there''s three people in the image - was the image taken in a week? Did you spend the week alone in that field? What? :p</td>', 'The title''s confusing to me... there''s three people in the image - was the image taken in a week? Did you spend the week alone in that field? What? :p', '2006-02-28 05:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189155, 298654, 50626, '<td valign="top">A moon-like photograph... very impressive for a basic editing challenge, but some strange stuff going on. The shades are very funky (likeable funky) but there''s one thing baffling me: there''s something in the sky that looks like it could be the moon, and if it is, it''s reflection in the water ~in front of the mountain~ seems kinda irrational. Well, either that, or you''ve got some neatly aligned dust particles on your sensor. Or, the third possibility, this is an orb hovering over the lake in low altitude and on this side of the mountain. Oh, and next time consider cropping out that little edge in the lower right hand corner.</td>', 'A moon-like photograph... very impressive for a basic editing challenge, but some strange stuff going on. The shades are very funky (likeable funky) but there''s one thing baffling me: there''s something in the sky that looks like it could be the moon, and if it is, it''s reflection in the water ~in front of the mountain~ seems kinda irrational. Well, either that, or you''ve got some neatly aligned dust particles on your sensor. Or, the third possibility, this is an orb hovering over the lake in low altitude and on this side of the mountain. Oh, and next time consider cropping out that little edge in the lower right hand corner.', '2006-02-28 05:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189158, 298817, 50626, '<td valign="top">I believe this is what they drew the filter name "Dry Brush" in Photoshop from...</td>', 'I believe this is what they drew the filter name "Dry Brush" in Photoshop from...', '2006-02-28 05:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189159, 297988, 50626, '<td valign="top">Refreshing duotone after a long session of rating black-and-whites.</td>', 'Refreshing duotone after a long session of rating black-and-whites.', '2006-02-28 05:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189161, 298736, 50626, '<td valign="top">A tight top-crop and perhaps a little too light on the contrast...</td>', 'A tight top-crop and perhaps a little too light on the contrast...', '2006-02-28 05:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2189162, 296831, 50626, '<td valign="top">Where''s the focus point?</td>', 'Where''s the focus point?', '2006-02-28 05:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
