(2189892, 296377, 19944, '<td valign="top">Something just seems odd about this photo and I can''t put my finger on it.  It seems like some sort of effect has been applied.  To me, it doesn''t help.</td>', 'Something just seems odd about this photo and I can''t put my finger on it.  It seems like some sort of effect has been applied.  To me, it doesn''t help.', '2006-02-28 14:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
