(2189974, 297064, 23430, '<td valign="top">Some good shadows cast on the chair here. The background is a bit cluttered distracting from the chair.</td>', 'Some good shadows cast on the chair here. The background is a bit cluttered distracting from the chair.', '2006-02-28 15:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
