(2190362, 297443, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very moody pic.  I love the starkness of the tree group in the foreground.  Your choice of tone doesn''t necessarily depict being parched, but the trees definitely do.  I also like the way that you show the shadow, which completes the upper part of the tree which we don''t see.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very moody pic.  I love the starkness of the tree group in the foreground.  Your choice of tone doesn''t necessarily depict being parched, but the trees definitely do.  I also like the way that you show the shadow, which completes the upper part of the tree which we don''t see.  Nice job.', '2006-02-28 18:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190366, 298049, 35602, '<td valign="top">This is very dark, which prevents me from appreciating what the image is.  Lighten it up a bit, and work a little with curves and any highlights that were blown out by increasing brightness would be taken care of.</td>', 'This is very dark, which prevents me from appreciating what the image is.  Lighten it up a bit, and work a little with curves and any highlights that were blown out by increasing brightness would be taken care of.', '2006-02-28 18:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190373, 296830, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice wingspan.  I think the light could have been better to really get the wing contours and the sharp contrast.</td>', 'Nice wingspan.  I think the light could have been better to really get the wing contours and the sharp contrast.', '2006-02-28 18:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190374, 298775, 44882, '<td valign="top">Sorry but not duotone...</td>', 'Sorry but not duotone...', '2006-02-28 18:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190381, 298309, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very strong contrast.  Love the way you caught the strands of hair as part of the silhouette.  Hey, is that an orb in the background? (lol)</td>', 'Very strong contrast.  Love the way you caught the strands of hair as part of the silhouette.  Hey, is that an orb in the background? (lol)', '2006-02-28 18:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190387, 296146, 35602, '<td valign="top">Your exposure was too long on this one.  You could have reduced the overblown highlights by adjusting your camera to a higher aperture, or even changing your iso to a lower number.  Night shots take a lot of practice, but it is worth the trying just to finally get those wonderful shots we all strive to get.</td>', 'Your exposure was too long on this one.  You could have reduced the overblown highlights by adjusting your camera to a higher aperture, or even changing your iso to a lower number.  Night shots take a lot of practice, but it is worth the trying just to finally get those wonderful shots we all strive to get.', '2006-02-28 18:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190396, 297883, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice emotive photo.</td>', 'Very nice emotive photo.', '2006-02-28 18:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190398, 297063, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think the duotone may have wrecked this image.  I hope we will see the color image when the challenge is over.</td>', 'I think the duotone may have wrecked this image.  I hope we will see the color image when the challenge is over.', '2006-02-28 18:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190400, 297266, 35602, '<td valign="top">Seems too oversharpened.  Perhaps just doing an unsharp mask would have been enough.</td>', 'Seems too oversharpened.  Perhaps just doing an unsharp mask would have been enough.', '2006-02-28 18:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190402, 296864, 35602, '<td valign="top">How about orbs?</td>', 'How about orbs?', '2006-02-28 18:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190406, 298654, 35602, '<td valign="top">Definitely a 10</td>', 'Definitely a 10', '2006-02-28 18:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190411, 298716, 35602, '<td valign="top">This could have done with more contrast, though it is hard to do when we are not allowed to dodge and burn.  It needed a sharper focus too so the detail of the icy branch could have shown better.  Maybe taking at a differenct time of day would have added the crispness this image needs.  Still, the attempt was a good one.  Keep on trying.  These snowscapes are worth the effort when you finally get that perfect shot.</td>', 'This could have done with more contrast, though it is hard to do when we are not allowed to dodge and burn.  It needed a sharper focus too so the detail of the icy branch could have shown better.  Maybe taking at a differenct time of day would have added the crispness this image needs.  Still, the attempt was a good one.  Keep on trying.  These snowscapes are worth the effort when you finally get that perfect shot.', '2006-02-28 18:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190413, 298815, 51802, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and DOF.  One of the best "pet" shots I have seen!</td>', 'Great lighting and DOF.  One of the best "pet" shots I have seen!', '2006-02-28 18:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190415, 297884, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast and detail on the wing feathers.  A little less centering of the strip the birds are on may have created less static with the image.  8</td>', 'Very nice contrast and detail on the wing feathers.  A little less centering of the strip the birds are on may have created less static with the image.  8', '2006-02-28 18:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190425, 296781, 51802, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is too harsh.  If you used a different light source and longer exposure it would help.  I also think a different perspective would help.  This stright down view doesn''t give the picture any depth.  Finially, the bacgound should have been cleaned up.  The dirt is distracting.</td>', 'The lighting on this is too harsh.  If you used a different light source and longer exposure it would help.  I also think a different perspective would help.  This stright down view doesn''t give the picture any depth.  Finially, the bacgound should have been cleaned up.  The dirt is distracting.', '2006-02-28 19:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190435, 298617, 35602, '<td valign="top">Well, the contrast is nice on the image.  The patterns in the background give it a bit of a tonal range.  I found the image to be kind of boring, though.  Just want to encourage you to think about what you are shooting, and asking yourself if it is interesting to a large amount of folks.</td>', 'Well, the contrast is nice on the image.  The patterns in the background give it a bit of a tonal range.  I found the image to be kind of boring, though.  Just want to encourage you to think about what you are shooting, and asking yourself if it is interesting to a large amount of folks.', '2006-02-28 19:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190436, 298618, 24486, '<td valign="top">Excellant all round (pun unintended). Just cant fault it</td>', 'Excellant all round (pun unintended). Just cant fault it', '2006-02-28 19:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190437, 296974, 51802, '<td valign="top">This shot meets the challenge well, it is just not that interesting.  Since the subject is a common object, the backgound should help bring interest to the subject.</td>', 'This shot meets the challenge well, it is just not that interesting.  Since the subject is a common object, the backgound should help bring interest to the subject.', '2006-02-28 19:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190439, 298452, 24486, '<td valign="top">Excellant action shot. I love the capture of expression on their faces.</td>', 'Excellant action shot. I love the capture of expression on their faces.', '2006-02-28 19:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190442, 298375, 35602, '<td valign="top">Excellent range of textures on this one, as well as good patterns all around.  Like the blue tone of this one, too.  Just a bit overblown under the lights, but not a big issue when you have such a strong image compositionally. 9</td>', 'Excellent range of textures on this one, as well as good patterns all around.  Like the blue tone of this one, too.  Just a bit overblown under the lights, but not a big issue when you have such a strong image compositionally. 9', '2006-02-28 19:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190445, 298540, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really fine black and white textures, and your eye is very clear and precise.  Dof was also well executed.  9</td>', 'Really fine black and white textures, and your eye is very clear and precise.  Dof was also well executed.  9', '2006-02-28 19:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190447, 298517, 35602, '<td valign="top">Need more highlights on this one.  It is  very muddy, which is probably from the fact that the wall has very little tonal quality.</td>', 'Need more highlights on this one.  It is  very muddy, which is probably from the fact that the wall has very little tonal quality.', '2006-02-28 19:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190449, 298875, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think this image would have been much better without the trees or hill in the background.  Get closer, take several angles and find the best section of the image.  Your color treatment matched well with your subject.  6</td>', 'I think this image would have been much better without the trees or hill in the background.  Get closer, take several angles and find the best section of the image.  Your color treatment matched well with your subject.  6', '2006-02-28 19:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190453, 298360, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice use of wide angle.  Found the subject to be generally too busy.  The centering of the mailboxes also cause the image to be too split in half.  I do like the way the sky looks, though, and the contrast of the mailboxes was pretty good.</td>', 'Nice use of wide angle.  Found the subject to be generally too busy.  The centering of the mailboxes also cause the image to be too split in half.  I do like the way the sky looks, though, and the contrast of the mailboxes was pretty good.', '2006-02-28 19:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190454, 296146, 24486, '<td valign="top">Im guessing this was hand held. If so, I would suggest using a tripod. If you do use a tripod, then dont put it too close to the traffic. The movement of the vehicles will actually cause the tripod to move &amp; give a blurry effect.</td>', 'Im guessing this was hand held. If so, I would suggest using a tripod. If you do use a tripod, then dont put it too close to the traffic. The movement of the vehicles will actually cause the tripod to move & give a blurry effect.', '2006-02-28 19:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190455, 296831, 51802, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very harsh.  Maybe a longer exposure without the flash would help.</td>', 'The lighting is very harsh.  Maybe a longer exposure without the flash would help.', '2006-02-28 19:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190458, 298085, 24486, '<td valign="top">Just seems a bit too dark to me.</td>', 'Just seems a bit too dark to me.', '2006-02-28 19:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2190469, 298037, 24486, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that you have comments about the size of this photograph. I suggest that you set which ever is the longest edge, in this case the vertical, to 640 pixels. I don''t know if the blurred effect was intentional but it doesn''t help this composition. I reccommend use of a tripod.</td>', 'I''m guessing that you have comments about the size of this photograph. I suggest that you set which ever is the longest edge, in this case the vertical, to 640 pixels. I don''t know if the blurred effect was intentional but it doesn''t help this composition. I reccommend use of a tripod.', '2006-02-28 19:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
