(2190933, 298654, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  If it weren''t for the deep colors, it might be kind of boring, but that''s not the case.  Lovely reflection and sky.</td>', 'Beautiful.  If it weren''t for the deep colors, it might be kind of boring, but that''s not the case.  Lovely reflection and sky.', '2006-02-28 23:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
