(2191097, 298498, 43434, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic first challenge picture ... and what a really good score ... congratulations .. I think this is sharp and well composed.</td>', 'What a fantastic first challenge picture ... and what a really good score ... congratulations .. I think this is sharp and well composed.', '2006-03-01 00:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
