(2191467, 298049, 46046, '<td valign="top">I''m going through my votes in reverse order and commenting on as many as I can ....  this shot to me has a lot of potential and I actually think the grain......buh...''scuse me.....NOISE.....adds to the shot.  That being said, it''s lacking something to live up to the title. <br/> Why am I going on?   To me, artistically speaking, don''t see going on here.  Why would I leave the light to drop off the end into the dark?  <br/>I will say that you have me thinking....and, maybe that is the most important thing.....<br/>I gave the photo a 3.<br/></td>', 'I''m going through my votes in reverse order and commenting on as many as I can ....  this shot to me has a lot of potential and I actually think the grain......buh...''scuse me.....NOISE.....adds to the shot.  That being said, it''s lacking something to live up to the title.  Why am I going on?   To me, artistically speaking, don''t see going on here.  Why would I leave the light to drop off the end into the dark?  I will say that you have me thinking....and, maybe that is the most important thing.....I gave the photo a 3.', '2006-03-01 01:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
