(2191628, 297055, 37893, '<td valign="top">I hope you see my comment as constructive and helpful in your pursuit to improve your photos ;) <br/> <br/>My first impression of this image is that it seems a bit oversharpened. The bare branches are a clear indication of this. While the blues create an aura of calm and coolness, it doesn''t help the balance with the oversharpened branches. <br/> <br/>The leading lines are great touch. Successful leading lines have something at the end of it to terminate the viewer''s eye. I like the barren feel of this road. It''s quite dynamic IMHO.<br/> <br/>I think you picked a great subject but unfortunately, the sky wasn''t being cooperative at the time. The blown highlights might have also hurt this image in my opinion.<br/> <br/>For your first challenge, this is a great start especially in a field of over 600 entries. Keep up the good work and you too will hit pay dirt soon.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/> <br/>Rikki</td>', 'I hope you see my comment as constructive and helpful in your pursuit to improve your photos ;)  My first impression of this image is that it seems a bit oversharpened. The bare branches are a clear indication of this. While the blues create an aura of calm and coolness, it doesn''t help the balance with the oversharpened branches.  The leading lines are great touch. Successful leading lines have something at the end of it to terminate the viewer''s eye. I like the barren feel of this road. It''s quite dynamic IMHO. I think you picked a great subject but unfortunately, the sky wasn''t being cooperative at the time. The blown highlights might have also hurt this image in my opinion. For your first challenge, this is a great start especially in a field of over 600 entries. Keep up the good work and you too will hit pay dirt soon. Cheers, Rikki', '2006-03-01 02:06:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2191629, 298330, 49737, '<td valign="top">Unlike some of the earlier comments, I think the contrast and coloring is spot on.  It looks like a nice classic photo without over accentuated contrast or ... well saturation doesn''t make sense in this challenge, but those two values tend to be tweaked too high to my liking on this site.</td>', 'Unlike some of the earlier comments, I think the contrast and coloring is spot on.  It looks like a nice classic photo without over accentuated contrast or ... well saturation doesn''t make sense in this challenge, but those two values tend to be tweaked too high to my liking on this site.', '2006-03-01 02:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
