(2191656, 296151, 37893, '<td valign="top">I hope you see my comment as constructive and helpful in your pursuit to improve your photos ;) <br/> <br/>My first impression of this image is that it is a well taken shot. Too much ground IMHO. I think with a greater expanse of the sky serving the negative space, this would have been up there. The tonal qualities are good but could use slight improvement. As you can see, some of the trees almost go to black in the background. The noise helps this image. It adds a certain flavor to the whole composition.<br/> <br/>Keep on practicing but most importantly have fun! This is a great image!<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/> <br/>Rikki<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-01 15:45:55.</i></td>', 'I hope you see my comment as constructive and helpful in your pursuit to improve your photos ;)  My first impression of this image is that it is a well taken shot. Too much ground IMHO. I think with a greater expanse of the sky serving the negative space, this would have been up there. The tonal qualities are good but could use slight improvement. As you can see, some of the trees almost go to black in the background. The noise helps this image. It adds a certain flavor to the whole composition. Keep on practicing but most importantly have fun! This is a great image! Cheers, Rikki', '2006-03-01 02:16:24.000000', '2006-03-01 15:45:55.000000', 0),
