(2191721, 298461, 46290, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that this is a great picture.  The only problem that I come up with is that the left side is where all the focus goes.  Because the right side is so dark, it appears that the interest is lost.  Maybe by sharpening or brightening the right side you could attract more attention to the buildings in the shadow.  This may also be a downfall of losing complete color.</td>', 'It seems to me that this is a great picture.  The only problem that I come up with is that the left side is where all the focus goes.  Because the right side is so dark, it appears that the interest is lost.  Maybe by sharpening or brightening the right side you could attract more attention to the buildings in the shadow.  This may also be a downfall of losing complete color.', '2006-03-01 02:48:04.000000', NULL, 0),
