(2192034, 297970, 49581, '<td valign="top">Hi, I didn''t get as far as this image in voting, but I think I would have given a 5 or 6.<br/> <br/>It''s a nice picture, and the composition is good, but it needs more DOF in the front.<br/> <br/>I think it''s harder to give more than a 6 because the image doesn''t say WOW! That doesn''t mean it''s a bad photo, but for a photo to do well on this site it really needs to stand out from the crowd.</td>', 'Hi, I didn''t get as far as this image in voting, but I think I would have given a 5 or 6. It''s a nice picture, and the composition is good, but it needs more DOF in the front. I think it''s harder to give more than a 6 because the image doesn''t say WOW! That doesn''t mean it''s a bad photo, but for a photo to do well on this site it really needs to stand out from the crowd.', '2006-03-01 06:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
