(2192351, 298955, 49094, '<td valign="top">I shot this image for another site''s scavenger hunt, then I saw the Duotone Challenge here. I decided to enter the image as a Duotone at the last minute. After uploading, I noticed the thread in the forum about clarifying the meaning of duotone. I had to laugh out loud when I saw that the previous winner was a feather with its shadow! I was not trying to duplicate the previous shot; I had no idea that it had even been done. When I was taking the first shots of the feather on white paper, I noticed the interesting shadow, so I had my husband hold the feather up off the paper to get a better composition. Just wanted to clear this up.</td>', 'I shot this image for another site''s scavenger hunt, then I saw the Duotone Challenge here. I decided to enter the image as a Duotone at the last minute. After uploading, I noticed the thread in the forum about clarifying the meaning of duotone. I had to laugh out loud when I saw that the previous winner was a feather with its shadow! I was not trying to duplicate the previous shot; I had no idea that it had even been done. When I was taking the first shots of the feather on white paper, I noticed the interesting shadow, so I had my husband hold the feather up off the paper to get a better composition. Just wanted to clear this up.', '2006-03-01 08:06:07.000000', NULL, 0),
