(2192582, 298335, 50695, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot. I gave it a 9. I bet some people didn''t think it was a duotone. That''s the only reason I can think of that your score isn''t higher.</td>', 'Terrific shot. I gave it a 9. I bet some people didn''t think it was a duotone. That''s the only reason I can think of that your score isn''t higher.', '2006-03-01 09:06:49.000000', NULL, 0),
