(2192584, 297268, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice, my friend.   I liked it even better then the corner of the world.  I bet the print was even better... more detail.</td>', 'Very nice, my friend.   I liked it even better then the corner of the world.  I bet the print was even better... more detail.', '2006-03-01 09:07:26.000000', NULL, 0),
