(2192587, 298548, 4226, '<td valign="top">Congrats Rich. Well captured!<br/>It was a great surprise to see another moving rock in the challenge :) <br/>I was there on the 18th, but a bit late, I might have reached after 5pm and the sun was already down...</td>', 'Congrats Rich. Well captured!It was a great surprise to see another moving rock in the challenge :) I was there on the 18th, but a bit late, I might have reached after 5pm and the sun was already down...', '2006-03-01 09:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2192592, 298730, 49581, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this should have scored higher, but my knowledge is not good enough to explain why it didn''t. If I could see a fault I would certainly tell you, but it looks well composed, great use of colour, only thing might be the building in the background is a little distracting, but not enough to warrant a 5.384 IMO. I didn''t get as far as voting on this image but if I had I''d have given a 7 or 8.</td>', 'In my opinion, this should have scored higher, but my knowledge is not good enough to explain why it didn''t. If I could see a fault I would certainly tell you, but it looks well composed, great use of colour, only thing might be the building in the background is a little distracting, but not enough to warrant a 5.384 IMO. I didn''t get as far as voting on this image but if I had I''d have given a 7 or 8.', '2006-03-01 09:11:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2192595, 298624, 52628, '<td valign="top">Congrats on you ribbon.  Very nice image, the duotone fits well.</td>', 'Congrats on you ribbon.  Very nice image, the duotone fits well.', '2006-03-01 09:12:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2192596, 297803, 2333, '<td valign="top">Heh heh,<br/>This was fun, Robert and I decided to submit our portraits of each other and see if folks would recognize us, or realize they were taken at the same place. Our crops were quite different, however, and I don''t think anyone caught on that the backgrounds were the same. Lots of folks recognized Robert, but I don''t think anyone recognized me, not surprisingly.<br/>What was interesting was the number of folks who thought this was a self-portrait, something which would have been quite out of character for Robert. In fact, we both share a "lack of enthusiasm" for doing self-portraits, LOL.</td>', 'Heh heh,This was fun, Robert and I decided to submit our portraits of each other and see if folks would recognize us, or realize they were taken at the same place. Our crops were quite different, however, and I don''t think anyone caught on that the backgrounds were the same. Lots of folks recognized Robert, but I don''t think anyone recognized me, not surprisingly.What was interesting was the number of folks who thought this was a self-portrait, something which would have been quite out of character for Robert. In fact, we both share a "lack of enthusiasm" for doing self-portraits, LOL.', '2006-03-01 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2192604, 298747, 50695, '<td valign="top">I loved the subtlety of this; it''s like an endlessly intricate lace pattern, because you have the pattern of the plant stand and then the pattern of the snow crystals. I was your 9.</td>', 'I loved the subtlety of this; it''s like an endlessly intricate lace pattern, because you have the pattern of the plant stand and then the pattern of the snow crystals. I was your 9.', '2006-03-01 09:15:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2192610, 296953, 50695, '<td valign="top">man, you was robbed. I guess people didn''t realize what you were doing.</td>', 'man, you was robbed. I guess people didn''t realize what you were doing.', '2006-03-01 09:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2192618, 296973, 3039, '<td valign="top">Way to go. Great near miss. Interesting, but I had all of the top five picks in my scoring methodology, and yours would have been number 2 behind the ultimate winner.<br/> <br/>Let me know if you need some help with the Gallery.</td>', 'Way to go. Great near miss. Interesting, but I had all of the top five picks in my scoring methodology, and yours would have been number 2 behind the ultimate winner. Let me know if you need some help with the Gallery.', '2006-03-01 09:20:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2192646, 297408, 45844, '<td valign="top">I liked this one too. All I can think of is that it''s a bit dark... Might have worked better in a full color challenge. Or a challenge with less than 600 entries :)</td>', 'I liked this one too. All I can think of is that it''s a bit dark... Might have worked better in a full color challenge. Or a challenge with less than 600 entries :)', '2006-03-01 09:28:57.000000', NULL, 0),
