(2192685, 297670, 45343, '<td valign="top">I liked this one alot... I also appreciate the way in which you converted it... think I''ll try it.   I was not at all bothered by the background becuase you used such a nice DoF.</td>', 'I liked this one alot... I also appreciate the way in which you converted it... think I''ll try it.   I was not at all bothered by the background becuase you used such a nice DoF.', '2006-03-01 09:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
