(2194864, 298730, 10818, '<td valign="top">This is my two cents...if you would have moved over two more inches to the left, you would not have that block of snow.  Because I do think it distracts from the photo.<br/> <br/>Lovely shot though.</td>', 'This is my two cents...if you would have moved over two more inches to the left, you would not have that block of snow.  Because I do think it distracts from the photo. Lovely shot though.', '2006-03-01 23:03:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2194899, 298335, 30959, '<td valign="top">I like the potential, the upper left shows some spots and does not add. I think cropping the left off would appeal more and bring the picture into a stronger duotonality. This does not rate the 1-3 scores in my opinion. I scored it an 8. Nice shot. Basic editing makes it tough, I know the finished product with this one will be very nice.</td>', 'I like the potential, the upper left shows some spots and does not add. I think cropping the left off would appeal more and bring the picture into a stronger duotonality. This does not rate the 1-3 scores in my opinion. I scored it an 8. Nice shot. Basic editing makes it tough, I know the finished product with this one will be very nice.', '2006-03-01 23:20:12.000000', NULL, 0),
