(2196933, 298386, 43434, '<td valign="top"><b><i>::: Critique Club :::</i></b> <br/> <br/>Hi, Kari from the critique club, I can making this painful but hell top ten ... what can I say!<br/> <br/><b>First Impression - the most important one:</b> <br/>Wow ... awesome colour for a duotone where everyone was saying that black and white and speia are going to make it.  <br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Lovely I love the crop here.  The twigs at the top and the bottom lead the eye perfectly to the right side fo the picture and the reflections add to the story being told.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Two colours .. duotone ... meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>Beautiful ... beautiful ... beautful ... what a place to be able to go to and see in natural colours .... <br/> <br/><b>To grow its vote?:</b> <br/>Shit I don''t know ..really less than .1 between you and fifth .. I know that annoyed me when it happened ... but not alot I could do ... you already know plenty about ribboning anyway .. what advice you got for me? :)<br/> <br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Great picture great colours .. and neat perspective .. well done.<br/> <br/>Any questions or comments feel free to PM me.<br/> <br/>Kari</td>', '::: Critique Club :::  Hi, Kari from the critique club, I can making this painful but hell top ten ... what can I say! First Impression - the most important one: Wow ... awesome colour for a duotone where everyone was saying that black and white and speia are going to make it.   Composition: Lovely I love the crop here.  The twigs at the top and the bottom lead the eye perfectly to the right side fo the picture and the reflections add to the story being told. Subject: Two colours .. duotone ... meets the challenge well. Technical (Colour and light): Beautiful ... beautiful ... beautful ... what a place to be able to go to and see in natural colours ....  To grow its vote?: Shit I don''t know ..really less than .1 between you and fifth .. I know that annoyed me when it happened ... but not alot I could do ... you already know plenty about ribboning anyway .. what advice you got for me? :) Summary: Great picture great colours .. and neat perspective .. well done. Any questions or comments feel free to PM me. Kari', '2006-03-02 20:58:18.000000', NULL, 0),
