(2249593, 298635, 53689, '<td valign="top">wow. this is a real original title for this picture. i have no idea how you came up with it. it probably took lots of thought and creativity. it really moved me. i felt a spritual connection with this picture because of the divine title. this title itself deserves an 11 as a vote, since pictures are all about their titles, you know?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-22 22:48:04.</i></td>', 'wow. this is a real original title for this picture. i have no idea how you came up with it. it probably took lots of thought and creativity. it really moved me. i felt a spritual connection with this picture because of the divine title. this title itself deserves an 11 as a vote, since pictures are all about their titles, you know?', '2006-03-22 22:46:23.000000', '2006-03-22 22:48:04.000000', 0),
