(2335051, 296393, 50466, '<td valign="top">Going for the grunge look are we? I would like it better if you stood out a little bit more. Another thing to consider is that there seems to be some perspective issues regarding the wall sof the house, as they seem to slope off (or maybe the building is just that dilapidated).  This could easily be fixed however by going to Edit&gt;Transfomr&gt;Perspective. Just my two cents. <br/> <br/>Charles</td>', 'Going for the grunge look are we? I would like it better if you stood out a little bit more. Another thing to consider is that there seems to be some perspective issues regarding the wall sof the house, as they seem to slope off (or maybe the building is just that dilapidated).  This could easily be fixed however by going to Edit>Transfomr>Perspective. Just my two cents.  Charles', '2006-04-22 14:57:50.000000', NULL, 0),
