(2381950, 296808, 48739, '<td valign="top">Really cool picture!! I love it!! Like the Black and white look... only thing i would pick at is that the bottome part of the leaf looks like it is in focus and as you run up the leaf it gose out. So basicly the focus is off just a little.... over all a great shot! if i was voting i would have gave it an 8!</td>', 'Really cool picture!! I love it!! Like the Black and white look... only thing i would pick at is that the bottome part of the leaf looks like it is in focus and as you run up the leaf it gose out. So basicly the focus is off just a little.... over all a great shot! if i was voting i would have gave it an 8!', '2006-05-04 12:51:04.000000', NULL, 0),
