(3562317, 296778, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is nice! I like that you converted it to black and white - it has just the right amount of highlights and shadows. Perfect!<br/> <br/>I don''t really understand why pet images are voted down, either. My theory, however is this: A lot of new users here may not really know exactly what to shoot. Then, "oh, my kitty cat!" and so they enter a shot that''s not really all that great. So, perhaps the voters have seen so many not very good pet photos, they just autimatically give you a bad vote and move on without really looking at the photo. :( I''ve had that same problem... Photos of my cat that I REALLY liked were give an average or below average score. <br/> <br/>Anyways, nice shot!</td>', 'This is nice! I like that you converted it to black and white - it has just the right amount of highlights and shadows. Perfect! I don''t really understand why pet images are voted down, either. My theory, however is this: A lot of new users here may not really know exactly what to shoot. Then, "oh, my kitty cat!" and so they enter a shot that''s not really all that great. So, perhaps the voters have seen so many not very good pet photos, they just autimatically give you a bad vote and move on without really looking at the photo. :( I''ve had that same problem... Photos of my cat that I REALLY liked were give an average or below average score.  Anyways, nice shot!', '2007-04-19 08:26:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3567854, 298872, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is the most amazing shot ... just love those negative spaces created by the bike and the legs and even his face and cap ..... love your b&amp;w treatment .... perfect .. &amp; 67 out''v 608 aint bad !!...:)</td>', 'this is the most amazing shot ... just love those negative spaces created by the bike and the legs and even his face and cap ..... love your b&w treatment .... perfect .. & 67 out''v 608 aint bad !!...:)', '2007-04-21 03:12:55.000000', NULL, 0),
