(6184655, 298898, 113419, '<td valign="top">Just cruising through some images and spotted this.  I like this shot.  I see lots of folks mentioned that it''s oof, but it works on this shot!  I like the black and white, I love the tree and the angles on the house are excellent.  A marvelous find for a photographer and (for me anyway) it''s a great capture!</td>', 'Just cruising through some images and spotted this.  I like this shot.  I see lots of folks mentioned that it''s oof, but it works on this shot!  I like the black and white, I love the tree and the angles on the house are excellent.  A marvelous find for a photographer and (for me anyway) it''s a great capture!', '2010-10-07 13:38:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6562683, 297254, 69008, '<td valign="top">Check to see that your camera is not set to max sharpening. It may be sharpening some in camera, and again when you process, and causing the problem along the tree line at the top.  Whatever you did to this one makes the bark on the main subject tree look good.  It''s a very contrasty scene, with the white clouds and dark foreground to deal with.</td>', 'Check to see that your camera is not set to max sharpening. It may be sharpening some in camera, and again when you process, and causing the problem along the tree line at the top.  Whatever you did to this one makes the bark on the main subject tree look good.  It''s a very contrasty scene, with the white clouds and dark foreground to deal with.', '2011-10-07 00:49:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6980357, 296973, 23484, '<td valign="top">The processing really draws the eyes in.</td>', 'The processing really draws the eyes in.', '2013-02-16 18:29:10.000000', NULL, 0),
